(894697, 103237, 11518, '<td valign="top">Great pic but unfortunately this could have been anywhere, any pond.  The picture does not convey a sense of place.</td>', 'Great pic but unfortunately this could have been anywhere, any pond.  The picture does not convey a sense of place.', '2004-09-06 01:23:39.000000', NULL, 1),
