(894767, 103218, 19982, '<td valign="top">This looks like a photo for the Framing challenge!  The colors, the angles, the sharpness all work well for me.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This looks like a photo for the Framing challenge!  The colors, the angles, the sharpness all work well for me.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2004-09-06 02:04:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(894773, 103064, 19982, '<td valign="top">Well, it *is* a travel guide!  Some people think a lot more creatively than me.  Great coloration and shapes.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Well, it *is* a travel guide!  Some people think a lot more creatively than me.  Great coloration and shapes.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2004-09-06 02:06:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(894779, 102941, 22010, '<td valign="top">This could''ve worked in the framing challenge too! Looks like a nice place.</td>', 'This could''ve worked in the framing challenge too! Looks like a nice place.', '2004-09-06 02:10:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(894783, 103220, 19982, '<td valign="top">Whew!  Beautiful colors, strong compositional lines, lovely textures.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Whew!  Beautiful colors, strong compositional lines, lovely textures.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2004-09-06 02:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(894787, 102741, 19982, '<td valign="top">Great lighting, looks like the perfect time of day.  Too bad there weren''t any clouds in the sky to give it some "texture".  I do like the diagonal line made by the windmills and the water.</td>', 'Great lighting, looks like the perfect time of day.  Too bad there weren''t any clouds in the sky to give it some "texture".  I do like the diagonal line made by the windmills and the water.', '2004-09-06 02:14:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(894789, 102350, 20779, '<td valign="top">Never seen anything like this photo. I don''t even know what to say, except this stopped me in my tracks.</td>', 'Never seen anything like this photo. I don''t even know what to say, except this stopped me in my tracks.', '2004-09-06 02:15:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(894792, 102267, 19982, '<td valign="top">Slight wide-angle curvature seen on the left.  I believe you''re allowed to adjust this in Advanced Editing, just use the Perspective Transform in PhotoShop.  I do love the shapes, the stark whites in contrast to the other elements, the blue sky, etc.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Slight wide-angle curvature seen on the left.  I believe you''re allowed to adjust this in Advanced Editing, just use the Perspective Transform in PhotoShop.  I do love the shapes, the stark whites in contrast to the other elements, the blue sky, etc.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2004-09-06 02:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(894794, 102677, 6477, '<td valign="top">I went to Reykjavik once and yes, only there you can see these colors... great composition &amp; beautiful background</td>', 'I went to Reykjavik once and yes, only there you can see these colors... great composition & beautiful background', '2004-09-06 02:19:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(894801, 102405, 8054, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition overall. Focus is mostly clear. My only issue is with the exposure as it feels a bit bright especially with details blown out in the clouds.</td>', 'Very nice composition overall. Focus is mostly clear. My only issue is with the exposure as it feels a bit bright especially with details blown out in the clouds.', '2004-09-06 02:22:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(894802, 102985, 19982, '<td valign="top">This would make a great marketing photo.  I love the tilt, the exposure, the overall "feel" of the various elements in the photograph.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'This would make a great marketing photo.  I love the tilt, the exposure, the overall "feel" of the various elements in the photograph.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2004-09-06 02:22:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(894806, 103122, 259, '<td valign="top">great b/w.  i really like how the hills contain multiple shades.  i also like the bold solid white border.  it seems to fit well.</td>', 'great b/w.  i really like how the hills contain multiple shades.  i also like the bold solid white border.  it seems to fit well.', '2004-09-06 02:24:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(894807, 103226, 25464, '<td valign="top">I really like this one.  it looks like a postcard.  I think the color could have been a bit more vivid with adjustment.</td>', 'I really like this one.  it looks like a postcard.  I think the color could have been a bit more vivid with adjustment.', '2004-09-06 02:24:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(894809, 102812, 6349, '<td valign="top">I was just reading a book on clouds and other sky phenomenon and I''m beating myself up right now because I can''t remember the name of those stripes in the sky.  This is a fantastic photo.  10</td>', 'I was just reading a book on clouds and other sky phenomenon and I''m beating myself up right now because I can''t remember the name of those stripes in the sky.  This is a fantastic photo.  10', '2004-09-06 02:25:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(894811, 103242, 8054, '<td valign="top">Although this is a nice sunset image, I don''t feel inspired by the road/path. I would like to see more scenery instead of pavement.</td>', 'Although this is a nice sunset image, I don''t feel inspired by the road/path. I would like to see more scenery instead of pavement.', '2004-09-06 02:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(894814, 102816, 6349, '<td valign="top">Wierd.  She looks exactly like my mom!  lol.  Very nice photo.  Great job with the exposure on this seems like it might have been difficult lighting situation.</td>', 'Wierd.  She looks exactly like my mom!  lol.  Very nice photo.  Great job with the exposure on this seems like it might have been difficult lighting situation.', '2004-09-06 02:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(894815, 101498, 259, '<td valign="top">great shot.  for some reason i''ve always liked shots that defy the rule of 3rds, and contain a lot of interesting sky.</td>', 'great shot.  for some reason i''ve always liked shots that defy the rule of 3rds, and contain a lot of interesting sky.', '2004-09-06 02:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(894816, 102973, 6349, '<td valign="top">Clone out the shadow on the path and I''d give this a 10.  It''s really bothering me.  I like how the natural framing surrounds only the windmill.  The colors seem a little too oversaturated.  9</td>', 'Clone out the shadow on the path and I''d give this a 10.  It''s really bothering me.  I like how the natural framing surrounds only the windmill.  The colors seem a little too oversaturated.  9', '2004-09-06 02:27:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(894817, 102638, 25464, '<td valign="top">This is a very interesting photo.  I think I would have focused more on the buildings in the background and cropped out some of the treeline background.  Very good shot.</td>', 'This is a very interesting photo.  I think I would have focused more on the buildings in the background and cropped out some of the treeline background.  Very good shot.', '2004-09-06 02:27:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(894818, 102985, 6349, '<td valign="top">Excellent image.  I really like the processing you have done.  The tilt gives it a youthful dynamic feel like a day of shopping.</td>', 'Excellent image.  I really like the processing you have done.  The tilt gives it a youthful dynamic feel like a day of shopping.', '2004-09-06 02:28:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(894820, 102812, 259, '<td valign="top">very impressive.  seems almost surreal.</td>', 'very impressive.  seems almost surreal.', '2004-09-06 02:29:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(894822, 103064, 25464, '<td valign="top">I am a sucker for the simplistic approach.  Nice shot.</td>', 'I am a sucker for the simplistic approach.  Nice shot.', '2004-09-06 02:29:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(894823, 102677, 8054, '<td valign="top">Amazing capture with the rainbow! I also like the way the rainbow arc traces the lines of the sculpture. Crop more off the bottom as the brickwork is unnecessary and maybe even some of the pedestal. Polarizers work wonders for rainbows and I bet you used one.</td>', 'Amazing capture with the rainbow! I also like the way the rainbow arc traces the lines of the sculpture. Crop more off the bottom as the brickwork is unnecessary and maybe even some of the pedestal. Polarizers work wonders for rainbows and I bet you used one.', '2004-09-06 02:29:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(894824, 103193, 6349, '<td valign="top">I love this photograph.  I''m a big fan of softening but whatever technique you used has left a strange halo like blurriness around the figure as well as in other places which I feel takes away from the image. 9</td>', 'I love this photograph.  I''m a big fan of softening but whatever technique you used has left a strange halo like blurriness around the figure as well as in other places which I feel takes away from the image. 9', '2004-09-06 02:30:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(894826, 103232, 25464, '<td valign="top">Straight from the cover of national geographic.  Great.</td>', 'Straight from the cover of national geographic.  Great.', '2004-09-06 02:30:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(894829, 102791, 22781, '<td valign="top">Nice picture overall. The tree on the left is a bit distracting</td>', 'Nice picture overall. The tree on the left is a bit distracting', '2004-09-06 02:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(894832, 102985, 259, '<td valign="top">i really like your shot.  it has a great urban feel to it.  probably not the typical travel guide shot, but it doesn''t matter to me.  10 all the way.</td>', 'i really like your shot.  it has a great urban feel to it.  probably not the typical travel guide shot, but it doesn''t matter to me.  10 all the way.', '2004-09-06 02:31:35.000000', NULL, 1),
