(894834, 103255, 6349, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  I would have liked to see a shot with more of what appears to be reflections of the sky in between the rocks in the foreground.  Either that, or without that one spot.  It''s all by itself and is pulling my eye away from the rest of the image.  If there was more of it that would be fantastic.  9</td>', 'Beautiful.  I would have liked to see a shot with more of what appears to be reflections of the sky in between the rocks in the foreground.  Either that, or without that one spot.  It''s all by itself and is pulling my eye away from the rest of the image.  If there was more of it that would be fantastic.  9', '2004-09-06 02:31:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(894835, 103141, 6349, '<td valign="top">10.  This is going to ribbon.</td>', '10.  This is going to ribbon.', '2004-09-06 02:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(894839, 101801, 259, '<td valign="top">great scene.  i really like how the posts lead you into the picture.</td>', 'great scene.  i really like how the posts lead you into the picture.', '2004-09-06 02:33:12.000000', NULL, 1),
