(894854, 103203, 259, '<td valign="top">very impressive.  great blues.  the use of the tire as a foreground subject makes your picture stand out above others.  without a strong foreground object it would get lost in the mix.  very nice job.</td>', 'very impressive.  great blues.  the use of the tire as a foreground subject makes your picture stand out above others.  without a strong foreground object it would get lost in the mix.  very nice job.', '2004-09-06 02:36:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(894855, 102899, 8054, '<td valign="top">This is an amazing perspective photo. Love the rocks in the foreground and the scenery in general. I do have issues with the big hill in the upper right corner, some minor focusing issues and the sky. The hill just feels out of place in a scene such as this. It would have been much better without that. The sky has a funny light purple tint and looks odd. Overall great photo.</td>', 'This is an amazing perspective photo. Love the rocks in the foreground and the scenery in general. I do have issues with the big hill in the upper right corner, some minor focusing issues and the sky. The hill just feels out of place in a scene such as this. It would have been much better without that. The sky has a funny light purple tint and looks odd. Overall great photo.', '2004-09-06 02:36:58.000000', NULL, 1),
