(894873, 102546, 6349, '<td valign="top">I like the photo but not the processing on this one.  I don''t like the effect of the selective desaturation as it calls attention to what I believe is not the main subject of the photo.  I also don''t like the bland sepia.  I think this would have worked well as a black and white done so that the lightness in the kids shirts stood out more and brought the viewers attention to them.  7</td>', 'I like the photo but not the processing on this one.  I don''t like the effect of the selective desaturation as it calls attention to what I believe is not the main subject of the photo.  I also don''t like the bland sepia.  I think this would have worked well as a black and white done so that the lightness in the kids shirts stood out more and brought the viewers attention to them.  7', '2004-09-06 02:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
