(895062, 101801, 25017, '<td valign="top">oooh the colours! just great!</td>', 'oooh the colours! just great!', '2004-09-06 04:38:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(895063, 103193, 8054, '<td valign="top">I can tell there was extensive dodging done because I see a small dark halo around the person and the shadow as well as the stone piling on the right. Not that it''s very distracting but it is fairly obvious. Not sure how much could have been saved you used levels and curves instead or tried different exposures.</td>', 'I can tell there was extensive dodging done because I see a small dark halo around the person and the shadow as well as the stone piling on the right. Not that it''s very distracting but it is fairly obvious. Not sure how much could have been saved you used levels and curves instead or tried different exposures.', '2004-09-06 04:38:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(895064, 102811, 25017, '<td valign="top">this pic has such promise but does not quite work out for me, lovely idea though</td>', 'this pic has such promise but does not quite work out for me, lovely idea though', '2004-09-06 04:40:22.000000', NULL, 1),
