(895191, 102518, 10390, '<td valign="top">This photo is truly the winner of this challenge for me.  The clouds are just great and they surely make this photo outstanding.  I will be very disappointed if this photo of yours will not have at least a ribbon! Congrats in advance!</td>', 'This photo is truly the winner of this challenge for me.  The clouds are just great and they surely make this photo outstanding.  I will be very disappointed if this photo of yours will not have at least a ribbon! Congrats in advance!', '2004-09-06 06:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
