(895339, 102303, 4871, '<td valign="top">When taking pics of travel destinations, it has to be a recognisable representation of the place. I have no idea where this shot is and it doesn''t really advertise it if I did know where it is. Try looking for something completely different that when you look at it you go ''WOW'' .</td>', 'When taking pics of travel destinations, it has to be a recognisable representation of the place. I have no idea where this shot is and it doesn''t really advertise it if I did know where it is. Try looking for something completely different that when you look at it you go ''WOW'' .', '2004-09-06 10:08:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(895341, 102653, 19952, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful subject for this challenge. It might be better with a little more light in the dark areas and if you got rid of that dark line down the left side, but I like the scenery you were able to capture here.</td>', 'This is a beautiful subject for this challenge. It might be better with a little more light in the dark areas and if you got rid of that dark line down the left side, but I like the scenery you were able to capture here.', '2004-09-06 10:09:17.000000', NULL, 1),
