(895605, 103265, 24642, '<td valign="top">Very sharp and crisp, loads of detail, I bet it looks fabulous in full screen.  I see that you have decided to let the moon peek above the house on the left, nice.  Very good viewpoint.  Just the right amount of light in the sky.  I also like that you kept in the entrance on the right and the traffic sign on the left.  One could argue if you should have cloned out the light reflections in the big window imo it disturbs the green mystical feel of the light inside.  Anyways this is a grand shot.</td>', 'Very sharp and crisp, loads of detail, I bet it looks fabulous in full screen.  I see that you have decided to let the moon peek above the house on the left, nice.  Very good viewpoint.  Just the right amount of light in the sky.  I also like that you kept in the entrance on the right and the traffic sign on the left.  One could argue if you should have cloned out the light reflections in the big window imo it disturbs the green mystical feel of the light inside.  Anyways this is a grand shot.', '2004-09-06 12:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
