(896474, 102166, 16046, '<td valign="top">I can see this in a guide book, I was just there 2 weeks ago, nice work</td>', 'I can see this in a guide book, I was just there 2 weeks ago, nice work', '2004-09-06 22:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(896479, 102427, 11738, '<td valign="top">I find the lighted part of the carillion a bit too saturated to my liking and there is a very visible hot spot.  I wonder if a shorter exposure time could have helped?</td>', 'I find the lighted part of the carillion a bit too saturated to my liking and there is a very visible hot spot.  I wonder if a shorter exposure time could have helped?', '2004-09-06 22:15:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(896480, 102332, 16046, '<td valign="top">great mood shot, good work</td>', 'great mood shot, good work', '2004-09-06 22:15:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(896481, 102741, 16046, '<td valign="top">Excellent compostion, great color, would like some more reflection in the foreground, good work</td>', 'Excellent compostion, great color, would like some more reflection in the foreground, good work', '2004-09-06 22:17:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(896483, 102322, 11738, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but too bad about those blown out windows and the right part of the cupola.  I have never tried this type of shot, but it must a nightmare to meter properly.  Good job centering your shot.</td>', 'Nice shot, but too bad about those blown out windows and the right part of the cupola.  I have never tried this type of shot, but it must a nightmare to meter properly.  Good job centering your shot.', '2004-09-06 22:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(896485, 103165, 16046, '<td valign="top">could have used a filter for the blow out sky, but that water fall is awesome. Nice work.</td>', 'could have used a filter for the blow out sky, but that water fall is awesome. Nice work.', '2004-09-06 22:19:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(896487, 102638, 16046, '<td valign="top">Very interesting image, nice lighting, well done</td>', 'Very interesting image, nice lighting, well done', '2004-09-06 22:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(896488, 102258, 11738, '<td valign="top">Nice urban shot, but slightly overexposed boats and condo towers.  Love the colours of the aquabus.</td>', 'Nice urban shot, but slightly overexposed boats and condo towers.  Love the colours of the aquabus.', '2004-09-06 22:20:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(896490, 102738, 16046, '<td valign="top">lovely image, nice work</td>', 'lovely image, nice work', '2004-09-06 22:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(896496, 102719, 11738, '<td valign="top">The expanse of beach does not really add any thing to the photo shot from so close to the ground.  I think a better approach would have been to get the camera as high as possible off the ground to give a better feeling of perspective.  The way it''s shot here almost shows us a grounded seagull''s point of view.  Very nice sky with wispy clouds.  Could have been underexposed a bit to get better colours on the buildings and to avoid blown out whites.</td>', 'The expanse of beach does not really add any thing to the photo shot from so close to the ground.  I think a better approach would have been to get the camera as high as possible off the ground to give a better feeling of perspective.  The way it''s shot here almost shows us a grounded seagull''s point of view.  Very nice sky with wispy clouds.  Could have been underexposed a bit to get better colours on the buildings and to avoid blown out whites.', '2004-09-06 22:24:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(896500, 102904, 23560, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites in this competition. I love the grittiness and texture in this.</td>', 'One of my favorites in this competition. I love the grittiness and texture in this.', '2004-09-06 22:26:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(896507, 103193, 11738, '<td valign="top">Nice soft feeling about this image, but that halo around the kid in the water is very distracting.  I have no idea what technique you used, but I''m pretty sure that proper use of gaussian blur could have avoided this artifact.  I''m just learning how to use Gaussian Blur myself and am quickly realizing that it can work wonders.</td>', 'Nice soft feeling about this image, but that halo around the kid in the water is very distracting.  I have no idea what technique you used, but I''m pretty sure that proper use of gaussian blur could have avoided this artifact.  I''m just learning how to use Gaussian Blur myself and am quickly realizing that it can work wonders.', '2004-09-06 22:29:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(896508, 103065, 23560, '<td valign="top">The grittiness is great. Love the overall mood to this pic. Well captured.</td>', 'The grittiness is great. Love the overall mood to this pic. Well captured.', '2004-09-06 22:29:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(896509, 102435, 23560, '<td valign="top">That''s one intimidating photograph. Well shot!</td>', 'That''s one intimidating photograph. Well shot!', '2004-09-06 22:29:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(896513, 101772, 11738, '<td valign="top">Nice grainy shot.  Looks like an old photo.</td>', 'Nice grainy shot.  Looks like an old photo.', '2004-09-06 22:30:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(896516, 102654, 11738, '<td valign="top">Bad title.  I know the image is straight, but the perspective of the bridge really gives the impression that the image leans to the right.</td>', 'Bad title.  I know the image is straight, but the perspective of the bridge really gives the impression that the image leans to the right.', '2004-09-06 22:35:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(896519, 103198, 11738, '<td valign="top">Man, I can''t get past how her shoulder blades are placed...  &lt;shiver&gt; looks like she''s a contortionist or something.  The eyes are drawn to them, which is most likely not the intention of your image.</td>', 'Man, I can''t get past how her shoulder blades are placed...  <shiver> looks like she''s a contortionist or something.  The eyes are drawn to them, which is most likely not the intention of your image.', '2004-09-06 22:38:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(896523, 102123, 11738, '<td valign="top">Nice image and good, if not quite appropriatefor the challenge, sepia treatment.  I usually imagine a colour image for "... an image that represents an area as a visitor might see it".  But that''s just me.</td>', 'Nice image and good, if not quite appropriatefor the challenge, sepia treatment.  I usually imagine a colour image for "... an image that represents an area as a visitor might see it".  But that''s just me.', '2004-09-06 22:41:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(896528, 102168, 11738, '<td valign="top">Sweet shot with great exposure.  Love how the lights lead the eyes through the shot.  A bit of keystoning on the building at the near left.</td>', 'Sweet shot with great exposure.  Love how the lights lead the eyes through the shot.  A bit of keystoning on the building at the near left.', '2004-09-06 22:43:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(896544, 102296, 11738, '<td valign="top">Nice sky, but the trees and hills are quite dark.  Could have used a bit of dodging.  I like how you have some trees in the foreground to frame the bottom of your image.</td>', 'Nice sky, but the trees and hills are quite dark.  Could have used a bit of dodging.  I like how you have some trees in the foreground to frame the bottom of your image.', '2004-09-06 22:57:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(896551, 102295, 11738, '<td valign="top">Very cool image, but way overprocessed for the requirements of the challenge.  Looks more like a painting in a gallery (and a good one at that) rather than a photograph.  I would also have cloned out that branch in the upper right corner.  Can you please let me know what process was used to achieve this result once the challenge over?  Thanks.</td>', 'Very cool image, but way overprocessed for the requirements of the challenge.  Looks more like a painting in a gallery (and a good one at that) rather than a photograph.  I would also have cloned out that branch in the upper right corner.  Can you please let me know what process was used to achieve this result once the challenge over?  Thanks.', '2004-09-06 23:02:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(896565, 103086, 8054, '<td valign="top">Great photo of a baseball game within the park. I love how they incorporated the Western Metal Supply Co bulding into the park itself. Nice lighting and great sunset in the sky. Feels a bit oversharpened but amazing photo nonetheless. 7</td>', 'Great photo of a baseball game within the park. I love how they incorporated the Western Metal Supply Co bulding into the park itself. Nice lighting and great sunset in the sky. Feels a bit oversharpened but amazing photo nonetheless. 7', '2004-09-06 23:17:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(896569, 103220, 8054, '<td valign="top">Love the composition here with the pier leading the eye to the lighthouses. I also like the subtle lighting of the sky although it seems contrast is a bit flat.</td>', 'Love the composition here with the pier leading the eye to the lighthouses. I also like the subtle lighting of the sky although it seems contrast is a bit flat.', '2004-09-06 23:19:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(896574, 102246, 8054, '<td valign="top">Very interesting building and I have seen this myself. The bottom of the photo should have been cropped a bit tighter as the trees are a bit distracting.</td>', 'Very interesting building and I have seen this myself. The bottom of the photo should have been cropped a bit tighter as the trees are a bit distracting.', '2004-09-06 23:21:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(896608, 103162, 1827, '<td valign="top">A very pretty shot.  The vibrant colors really sing.  The title though makes me want to see the lake.</td>', 'A very pretty shot.  The vibrant colors really sing.  The title though makes me want to see the lake.', '2004-09-06 23:42:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(896609, 102746, 25773, '<td valign="top">A great composition but I miss people or at least a person... An empty beach is not that attractive in a travel guide.</td>', 'A great composition but I miss people or at least a person... An empty beach is not that attractive in a travel guide.', '2004-09-06 23:42:33.000000', NULL, 1),
