(896711, 102968, 16618, '<td valign="top">I love the B&amp;W!  This makes me smile...great capture!</td>', 'I love the B&W!  This makes me smile...great capture!', '2004-09-07 00:53:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(896712, 102546, 19936, '<td valign="top">Very appealing shot but I''m not sure if it would not have been better to either make it all b/w or all color.  But I still think it was a great capture fitting the subject.</td>', 'Very appealing shot but I''m not sure if it would not have been better to either make it all b/w or all color.  But I still think it was a great capture fitting the subject.', '2004-09-07 00:53:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(896713, 101797, 16618, '<td valign="top">Unique perspective and great color!</td>', 'Unique perspective and great color!', '2004-09-07 00:53:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(896714, 102899, 16618, '<td valign="top">Simply beautiful!  I love how the title makes your eye travel to the single island.</td>', 'Simply beautiful!  I love how the title makes your eye travel to the single island.', '2004-09-07 00:54:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(896715, 103163, 16618, '<td valign="top">Simply stunning shot.  I love the silouette!</td>', 'Simply stunning shot.  I love the silouette!', '2004-09-07 00:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(896716, 102126, 16618, '<td valign="top">I love the reflection and how the branches frame the shot.</td>', 'I love the reflection and how the branches frame the shot.', '2004-09-07 00:54:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(896721, 103163, 6477, '<td valign="top">I would love to go there=)</td>', 'I would love to go there=)', '2004-09-07 00:58:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(896724, 102666, 19936, '<td valign="top">Wow, great color.  I think this shot would have benefited form a little more definition in the body area of the bird.  But overall great job!</td>', 'Wow, great color.  I think this shot would have benefited form a little more definition in the body area of the bird.  But overall great job!', '2004-09-07 01:00:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(896727, 102676, 19936, '<td valign="top">The lighting makes this very dramatic.</td>', 'The lighting makes this very dramatic.', '2004-09-07 01:02:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(896731, 103086, 19952, '<td valign="top">Wow - that''s such an amazing shot that it almost doesn''t look real. Those colors may be the best I''ve seen in any shot of this kind. Really great job!</td>', 'Wow - that''s such an amazing shot that it almost doesn''t look real. Those colors may be the best I''ve seen in any shot of this kind. Really great job!', '2004-09-07 01:03:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(896736, 101704, 19936, '<td valign="top">I love this shot.  The action, the drama.  Good choice of color on b/w.  I know it is nitpicking but to bad the bull''s head is a little out of focus, otherwise a 10 from me.</td>', 'I love this shot.  The action, the drama.  Good choice of color on b/w.  I know it is nitpicking but to bad the bull''s head is a little out of focus, otherwise a 10 from me.', '2004-09-07 01:05:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(896742, 103012, 19936, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Makes me want to visit Minneapolis.  I can see this shot in a Travel Guide for the city.  Good job.</td>', 'Wow!  Makes me want to visit Minneapolis.  I can see this shot in a Travel Guide for the city.  Good job.', '2004-09-07 01:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(896743, 102350, 19952, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite shot of this challenge. You caught it at the perfect time of day and did an excellent job of composing the shot and getting the right amount of light. I hope this does end up in a  travel guide!</td>', 'This is my favorite shot of this challenge. You caught it at the perfect time of day and did an excellent job of composing the shot and getting the right amount of light. I hope this does end up in a  travel guide!', '2004-09-07 01:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(896748, 101801, 19936, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast between the dark rainy sky and bright flats (I assume Great Salt Lake?).  Not sure I would use it in a travel guide though as a tourist would prefer a sunny sky (unless they were one of us : ) )<br/> <br/></td>', 'I like the contrast between the dark rainy sky and bright flats (I assume Great Salt Lake?).  Not sure I would use it in a travel guide though as a tourist would prefer a sunny sky (unless they were one of us : ) ) ', '2004-09-07 01:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(896749, 103255, 19952, '<td valign="top">I love this photo! It really does belong in a travel guide. I would probably like the shot a bit better if the composition were shifted up slightly to show more sky and less foreground, but it''s absolutely beautiful as is. Great job!</td>', 'I love this photo! It really does belong in a travel guide. I would probably like the shot a bit better if the composition were shifted up slightly to show more sky and less foreground, but it''s absolutely beautiful as is. Great job!', '2004-09-07 01:14:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(896754, 103241, 19936, '<td valign="top">Great subject.  The background seems a bit cluttered, maybe if it was blurred out?  Overall good shot though.</td>', 'Great subject.  The background seems a bit cluttered, maybe if it was blurred out?  Overall good shot though.', '2004-09-07 01:20:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(896756, 101884, 19952, '<td valign="top">I love the color, texture and the nice tight crop of this shot. Really great job!</td>', 'I love the color, texture and the nice tight crop of this shot. Really great job!', '2004-09-07 01:20:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(896759, 102332, 19952, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t really look like a tourist destination, but it''s still one of my favorite shots in this challenge. The mist looks great and you still managed to get deep, rich colors even in low light. Great job.</td>', 'This doesn''t really look like a tourist destination, but it''s still one of my favorite shots in this challenge. The mist looks great and you still managed to get deep, rich colors even in low light. Great job.', '2004-09-07 01:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(896761, 102007, 19936, '<td valign="top">This hot has wow factor, good job.  Was the sky above the clouds really that dark or did you do some burning?</td>', 'This hot has wow factor, good job.  Was the sky above the clouds really that dark or did you do some burning?', '2004-09-07 01:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(896768, 102774, 19936, '<td valign="top">I like the wall leading to the subject, good composition.  For a travel guide I think I might try to find a view of the building that did not have the builing blocking it, that is if it is possible.  Overall good shot.</td>', 'I like the wall leading to the subject, good composition.  For a travel guide I think I might try to find a view of the building that did not have the builing blocking it, that is if it is possible.  Overall good shot.', '2004-09-07 01:29:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(896776, 103141, 19936, '<td valign="top">Great sunset.  Tthe subject is a little blurred though or just not enough of the focus in the overall picture.  I might have zoomed in a little and skipped the reflection of the pond since it is not that dramatic, at least compared to the sunset.  But shat a sunset capture!</td>', 'Great sunset.  Tthe subject is a little blurred though or just not enough of the focus in the overall picture.  I might have zoomed in a little and skipped the reflection of the pond since it is not that dramatic, at least compared to the sunset.  But shat a sunset capture!', '2004-09-07 01:34:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(896780, 102332, 19936, '<td valign="top">This photo has lots of interest.  Good capture of the mist and dramatic colors.</td>', 'This photo has lots of interest.  Good capture of the mist and dramatic colors.', '2004-09-07 01:38:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(896785, 103266, 8054, '<td valign="top">Composition is good overall but I think it could be cropped a bit tighter on the bottom as it currently puts the city skyline in the very middle. Color balance is also off with too much red.</td>', 'Composition is good overall but I think it could be cropped a bit tighter on the bottom as it currently puts the city skyline in the very middle. Color balance is also off with too much red.', '2004-09-07 01:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(896790, 103052, 19936, '<td valign="top">Good job.  This is a different perspective of an often photographed subject.</td>', 'Good job.  This is a different perspective of an often photographed subject.', '2004-09-07 01:45:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(896792, 102677, 19936, '<td valign="top">What timing for this contest.  Did you order up that rainbow?  I know it is a little picky but its too bad the exposure washed out that brighter cloud behind the rainbow.   Good shot though and overall good job.</td>', 'What timing for this contest.  Did you order up that rainbow?  I know it is a little picky but its too bad the exposure washed out that brighter cloud behind the rainbow.   Good shot though and overall good job.', '2004-09-07 01:50:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(896794, 103165, 19936, '<td valign="top">I like the softness of the water, makes the falls more inviting.  Good job.</td>', 'I like the softness of the water, makes the falls more inviting.  Good job.', '2004-09-07 01:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(896798, 103247, 19936, '<td valign="top">This is magic.  To make all that open Texas landscape look inviting!  Good job!<br/> <br/></td>', 'This is magic.  To make all that open Texas landscape look inviting!  Good job! ', '2004-09-07 01:56:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(896802, 102508, 19936, '<td valign="top">Great landscape.  Only improvement (for my eyes anyway) might be to crop the grasslands out just under the left rock formation.  But still a 9 from me.  Good job.</td>', 'Great landscape.  Only improvement (for my eyes anyway) might be to crop the grasslands out just under the left rock formation.  But still a 9 from me.  Good job.', '2004-09-07 01:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(896805, 103217, 19936, '<td valign="top">I love this shot.  The river going diagonally through the photo from corner to corner is perfect.  A winner!</td>', 'I love this shot.  The river going diagonally through the photo from corner to corner is perfect.  A winner!', '2004-09-07 02:01:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(896806, 101658, 19936, '<td valign="top">Hey, I live near here and this was a great capture for the weather we had during this contest.  Pretty standard Seattle tourist shot that is on many of the postcards so it certainly meets the subject.  Good job.</td>', 'Hey, I live near here and this was a great capture for the weather we had during this contest.  Pretty standard Seattle tourist shot that is on many of the postcards so it certainly meets the subject.  Good job.', '2004-09-07 02:06:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(896810, 102952, 19936, '<td valign="top">Does not make me want to visit but I can see this shot in a City promo.  Good job overall.</td>', 'Does not make me want to visit but I can see this shot in a City promo.  Good job overall.', '2004-09-07 02:08:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(896811, 103163, 19936, '<td valign="top">When can I go?  I can see this photo in a travel guide for fishing the lakes of Canada.  If I had had one more day I might have entered one similar with a sailboat but .....<br/>Good job.</td>', 'When can I go?  I can see this photo in a travel guide for fishing the lakes of Canada.  If I had had one more day I might have entered one similar with a sailboat but .....Good job.', '2004-09-07 02:09:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(896813, 103086, 19936, '<td valign="top">Is this a postcard?  It should be.  Great job!  You must have brought your tripod to the game because you captured such great depth, clarity and color.</td>', 'Is this a postcard?  It should be.  Great job!  You must have brought your tripod to the game because you captured such great depth, clarity and color.', '2004-09-07 02:12:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(896814, 102416, 19936, '<td valign="top">Great exposure.  Dramatic sunset while maintaining the reflection of clouds in the water is something I dont often capture.  And the detail of the clouds is maintained!  Im jealous!</td>', 'Great exposure.  Dramatic sunset while maintaining the reflection of clouds in the water is something I dont often capture.  And the detail of the clouds is maintained!  Im jealous!', '2004-09-07 02:13:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(896816, 102968, 19936, '<td valign="top">Good shot in what looks like a difficult lighting situation.  Would have been tops if the light had been from the front right, but hey, Im sure you could not climb in the enclosure!</td>', 'Good shot in what looks like a difficult lighting situation.  Would have been tops if the light had been from the front right, but hey, Im sure you could not climb in the enclosure!', '2004-09-07 02:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(896819, 101884, 19936, '<td valign="top">What clarity and color!  This is one of the top photos today.  What is the reflection? in the back upper left?  One of my top picks.</td>', 'What clarity and color!  This is one of the top photos today.  What is the reflection? in the back upper left?  One of my top picks.', '2004-09-07 02:17:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(896820, 102258, 19936, '<td valign="top">This is a great capture of one of my favorite cities.  A little washed out on the closest buildings but good job overall.</td>', 'This is a great capture of one of my favorite cities.  A little washed out on the closest buildings but good job overall.', '2004-09-07 02:18:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(896857, 101592, 19608, '<td valign="top">Some people are just 100 years before their time.  It''s great image, but not in a travel guide quite yet.</td>', 'Some people are just 100 years before their time.  It''s great image, but not in a travel guide quite yet.', '2004-09-07 02:49:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(896861, 102285, 19608, '<td valign="top">Excellent skyline.  Colors are magnificent but it would be better taken a bit earlier when you could capture the dark blue in the sky.</td>', 'Excellent skyline.  Colors are magnificent but it would be better taken a bit earlier when you could capture the dark blue in the sky.', '2004-09-07 02:51:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(896863, 103247, 19608, '<td valign="top">What''s perfect?  a) Exposure.  b) Composition. c) Mood.  It just needs a slight injection of the WOW factor to be a real top contender.</td>', 'What''s perfect?  a) Exposure.  b) Composition. c) Mood.  It just needs a slight injection of the WOW factor to be a real top contender.', '2004-09-07 02:54:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(896864, 103266, 19608, '<td valign="top">Gosh - so serene.  Composition is perfect - the only minor thing I''d like to do is move the sailboat left over towards the brightly reflected building.  Colora re magical.  Exposure is dead on in every respect.</td>', 'Gosh - so serene.  Composition is perfect - the only minor thing I''d like to do is move the sailboat left over towards the brightly reflected building.  Colora re magical.  Exposure is dead on in every respect.', '2004-09-07 02:56:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(896866, 102811, 19608, '<td valign="top">A great scenic - lit with both backlight and flash.  The border holds it together - coming from one who normally doesn''t like them much.  I wish you could tie it to a actual destination somehow.</td>', 'A great scenic - lit with both backlight and flash.  The border holds it together - coming from one who normally doesn''t like them much.  I wish you could tie it to a actual destination somehow.', '2004-09-07 02:58:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(896870, 103263, 19608, '<td valign="top">I want to go there!  Great colors - the pastel pallete really works well.  At first glance it appears like the horizon isn''t level due to the wave patterns.  Texture in the forground water is great - but you may want to crop out some of the sky to keep the horizon away from dead center.</td>', 'I want to go there!  Great colors - the pastel pallete really works well.  At first glance it appears like the horizon isn''t level due to the wave patterns.  Texture in the forground water is great - but you may want to crop out some of the sky to keep the horizon away from dead center.', '2004-09-07 03:01:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(896900, 102166, 17503, '<td valign="top">you have to be careful with focus point...I think it should be on the face, but a pleasing image nonetheless.</td>', 'you have to be careful with focus point...I think it should be on the face, but a pleasing image nonetheless.', '2004-09-07 03:29:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(896942, 102982, 6130, '<td valign="top">Lovely.</td>', 'Lovely.', '2004-09-07 05:16:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(896945, 103203, 22459, '<td valign="top">Straight out of travel guide excellent colors and composition</td>', 'Straight out of travel guide excellent colors and composition', '2004-09-07 05:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(896946, 102523, 24911, '<td valign="top">A nice shot, but too blurred and too dark IMO.</td>', 'A nice shot, but too blurred and too dark IMO.', '2004-09-07 05:26:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(896947, 102007, 22459, '<td valign="top">EDIT: "unhelpful" comment removed by voter<br/><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-10-05 06:19:16.</i></td>', 'EDIT: "unhelpful" comment removed by voter', '2004-09-07 05:28:39.000000', '2005-10-05 07:19:16.000000', 1),
(896949, 103238, 24911, '<td valign="top">A great photo and colors, but I don''t think it fits the challenge.</td>', 'A great photo and colors, but I don''t think it fits the challenge.', '2004-09-07 05:28:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(896951, 103198, 24911, '<td valign="top">I would have like to see the houses in focus, and as the main subject, and not the woman.</td>', 'I would have like to see the houses in focus, and as the main subject, and not the woman.', '2004-09-07 05:30:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(896954, 102902, 24911, '<td valign="top">The photo is too dark, and I can''t see any swans...</td>', 'The photo is too dark, and I can''t see any swans...', '2004-09-07 05:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(896963, 102007, 16493, '<td valign="top">composition would be better if the tree would not be in the center.</td>', 'composition would be better if the tree would not be in the center.', '2004-09-07 05:44:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(896964, 102741, 18870, '<td valign="top">is that Kinderdyk?  I took almost the exact same photo there in August.  Very cool shot.</td>', 'is that Kinderdyk?  I took almost the exact same photo there in August.  Very cool shot.', '2004-09-07 05:45:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(896965, 102518, 18870, '<td valign="top">Absolutely stunning!!!!!  Great work!  WOW.</td>', 'Absolutely stunning!!!!!  Great work!  WOW.', '2004-09-07 05:48:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(896967, 102811, 16493, '<td valign="top">IMO, too much light on the hnads, the bacground should be more into focus or more out of focus. Good idea for the travel gudie theme.</td>', 'IMO, too much light on the hnads, the bacground should be more into focus or more out of focus. Good idea for the travel gudie theme.', '2004-09-07 05:49:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(896968, 103212, 16493, '<td valign="top">needs something to get the feeling of the size.</td>', 'needs something to get the feeling of the size.', '2004-09-07 05:50:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(896974, 103162, 20012, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, except for two things: the part of the building touching the top of the frame, and the over-saturated colors. The blur in the trees on the right also looks a bit strange, looks like you did some editing in the sky.<br/>But apart from that, that''s exactly the picture I would expect on the hotel''s website or in a promo folder.</td>', 'Nice picture, except for two things: the part of the building touching the top of the frame, and the over-saturated colors. The blur in the trees on the right also looks a bit strange, looks like you did some editing in the sky.But apart from that, that''s exactly the picture I would expect on the hotel''s website or in a promo folder.', '2004-09-07 06:24:01.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(896976, 102530, 20012, '<td valign="top">Nice subject, but it looks a bit too dark to me, and the horizon is also tilted a bit (the tilted buildings on the left look extremely weird ;). Perhaps lessening the contrast would improve the "dark" problem, and might also give you some detail in some of the areas that are practically all black. It might also be worth a try converting the image to greyscale and playing around with the contrast then.</td>', 'Nice subject, but it looks a bit too dark to me, and the horizon is also tilted a bit (the tilted buildings on the left look extremely weird ;). Perhaps lessening the contrast would improve the "dark" problem, and might also give you some detail in some of the areas that are practically all black. It might also be worth a try converting the image to greyscale and playing around with the contrast then.', '2004-09-07 06:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(896980, 102246, 20012, '<td valign="top">Is that the sun setting in the background? That could have been brought out a bit better, perhaps. I would crop away the left fifth or so (most of the buildings) to concentrate more on the shape that''s interesting. And maybe also crop a bit from the bottom ... hmm that might make it a bit too abstract, but would be worth a try.<br/>It''s also a tad too dark for me, sunset or not.</td>', 'Is that the sun setting in the background? That could have been brought out a bit better, perhaps. I would crop away the left fifth or so (most of the buildings) to concentrate more on the shape that''s interesting. And maybe also crop a bit from the bottom ... hmm that might make it a bit too abstract, but would be worth a try.It''s also a tad too dark for me, sunset or not.', '2004-09-07 06:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(896982, 102093, 20012, '<td valign="top">This is perfect ;) If it was more postcard-shaped, I''d say it''s the perfect postcard photo ;)</td>', 'This is perfect ;) If it was more postcard-shaped, I''d say it''s the perfect postcard photo ;)', '2004-09-07 06:33:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(896984, 103152, 20012, '<td valign="top">This photo is a bit too busy for my taste. Taking this with a wide-angle lens from somewhere on the beach would have been much more interesting.</td>', 'This photo is a bit too busy for my taste. Taking this with a wide-angle lens from somewhere on the beach would have been much more interesting.', '2004-09-07 06:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(896988, 103053, 20012, '<td valign="top">The sunshade looks great, but the bottom of the picture is too dark. Perhaps playing around with the contrast would have saved it. Great idea, though.</td>', 'The sunshade looks great, but the bottom of the picture is too dark. Perhaps playing around with the contrast would have saved it. Great idea, though.', '2004-09-07 06:37:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(896989, 103203, 20012, '<td valign="top">Great! Very good use of a foreground object to add depth. Beautiful!</td>', 'Great! Very good use of a foreground object to add depth. Beautiful!', '2004-09-07 06:42:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(896991, 102117, 20012, '<td valign="top">Simply amazing. The colors, the bird silhouettes. Wonderful.</td>', 'Simply amazing. The colors, the bird silhouettes. Wonderful.', '2004-09-07 06:44:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(896994, 103223, 24613, '<td valign="top">Great shot!</td>', 'Great shot!', '2004-09-07 06:53:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(897002, 102677, 19982, '<td valign="top">Stunning!  What a perfect moment for lighting...  from the lighting of the subject, tot he lighting of the clouds and finished by a rainbow.  Excellent colors and sharpness.  I hope you do well in the challenge!</td>', 'Stunning!  What a perfect moment for lighting...  from the lighting of the subject, tot he lighting of the clouds and finished by a rainbow.  Excellent colors and sharpness.  I hope you do well in the challenge!', '2004-09-07 07:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(897035, 103240, 259, '<td valign="top">easily one of the better pictures in the challenge.  if i were to nitpick, and find something to improve on, it would be to clone out the cloud that''s cut in half on the right edge.  my eye tends to be drawn to it, because it''s darker than the surrounding sky.  that said, it''s very minor and doesn''t stop me from giving a 10.</td>', 'easily one of the better pictures in the challenge.  if i were to nitpick, and find something to improve on, it would be to clone out the cloud that''s cut in half on the right edge.  my eye tends to be drawn to it, because it''s darker than the surrounding sky.  that said, it''s very minor and doesn''t stop me from giving a 10.', '2004-09-07 07:58:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(897037, 103237, 259, '<td valign="top">i really like the dark background.  it helps make the white jump from it''s surroundings.</td>', 'i really like the dark background.  it helps make the white jump from it''s surroundings.', '2004-09-07 08:00:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(897038, 102124, 259, '<td valign="top">i like the compostion, however, the focus seems to be more on the grass in front than anywhere else.</td>', 'i like the compostion, however, the focus seems to be more on the grass in front than anywhere else.', '2004-09-07 08:01:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(897040, 102666, 259, '<td valign="top">the dark background works well with the bold bright colors.  nice job.</td>', 'the dark background works well with the bold bright colors.  nice job.', '2004-09-07 08:02:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(897041, 103073, 259, '<td valign="top">great texture in the sky.</td>', 'great texture in the sky.', '2004-09-07 08:03:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(897043, 101772, 10170, '<td valign="top">I like your use of grain here a lot.</td>', 'I like your use of grain here a lot.', '2004-09-07 08:05:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(897044, 103051, 259, '<td valign="top">great looking sky.  the clouds are impressive.  i also like the people.  they add both a sense of size and a personal dimension that many of the landscape pics in the challenge lack.</td>', 'great looking sky.  the clouds are impressive.  i also like the people.  they add both a sense of size and a personal dimension that many of the landscape pics in the challenge lack.', '2004-09-07 08:06:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(897046, 102941, 10170, '<td valign="top">Very nice use of the pillars as a frame.  Great work.  Can''t place exactly where this is though.  Thought it might be the spit but not really sure.</td>', 'Very nice use of the pillars as a frame.  Great work.  Can''t place exactly where this is though.  Thought it might be the spit but not really sure.', '2004-09-07 08:07:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(897047, 103156, 259, '<td valign="top">the picture feels crowded.  the crop might have been just a bit too tight.</td>', 'the picture feels crowded.  the crop might have been just a bit too tight.', '2004-09-07 08:08:01.000000', NULL, 1),
