(897088, 102518, 19952, '<td valign="top">This is an amazing shot. The lights, building and water look great, but the sky looks almost unreal. I don''t know if that''s the effect of shining bright lights on moving clouds over a long period of time, but it just seems so unusual. Regardless, this is a beautiful photo - one of my favorites from the challenge.</td>', 'This is an amazing shot. The lights, building and water look great, but the sky looks almost unreal. I don''t know if that''s the effect of shining bright lights on moving clouds over a long period of time, but it just seems so unusual. Regardless, this is a beautiful photo - one of my favorites from the challenge.', '2004-09-07 08:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(897089, 103241, 3569, '<td valign="top">fill-in flash would have helped the shadows</td>', 'fill-in flash would have helped the shadows', '2004-09-07 08:47:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(897090, 103074, 17503, '<td valign="top">I would have cropped to just show the top half of the image to emphasize the trees and the reflections....nice photo!</td>', 'I would have cropped to just show the top half of the image to emphasize the trees and the reflections....nice photo!', '2004-09-07 08:47:32.000000', NULL, 1),
