(897097, 102007, 19952, '<td valign="top">This is such a beautiful shot. The only thing that is distracting for me is how light the sky is at the bottom and how dark it is at the top. If you want to edit that, you can select all of the blue parts of the sky, adjust curves until just the top looks good, then apply a gradient mask downward to apply the change more to the top of the sky than to the bottom. But that could be a lot of trouble to go through to marginally improve an already beautiful image.</td>', 'This is such a beautiful shot. The only thing that is distracting for me is how light the sky is at the bottom and how dark it is at the top. If you want to edit that, you can select all of the blue parts of the sky, adjust curves until just the top looks good, then apply a gradient mask downward to apply the change more to the top of the sky than to the bottom. But that could be a lot of trouble to go through to marginally improve an already beautiful image.', '2004-09-07 08:52:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(897098, 103086, 3569, '<td valign="top">A poster shot... Nice</td>', 'A poster shot... Nice', '2004-09-07 08:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(897100, 102435, 3569, '<td valign="top">IMO this doesn''t fit the challenge..1</td>', 'IMO this doesn''t fit the challenge..1', '2004-09-07 08:54:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(897102, 102161, 19952, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful photo, I assume from Treasure Island. It actually looks like the shot might benefit from a little more light, either by adjusting the ISO or shutter time. That would make the buildings shine more with more colors and might show some of the water reflections. Of course, it''s not easy to get a clear night here in the summer, so light can be pretty hard to come by. :-)</td>', 'This is a beautiful photo, I assume from Treasure Island. It actually looks like the shot might benefit from a little more light, either by adjusting the ISO or shutter time. That would make the buildings shine more with more colors and might show some of the water reflections. Of course, it''s not easy to get a clear night here in the summer, so light can be pretty hard to come by. :-)', '2004-09-07 08:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(897153, 101818, 9089, '<td valign="top">While this picture may not be the most expected photo for a challenge, it is definitely one that I would see in a travel book.  I do like the semi-repetitive pattern in it.  Also filling the frame with the shirts works very well.  It does seem like it could be just a little sharper.</td>', 'While this picture may not be the most expected photo for a challenge, it is definitely one that I would see in a travel book.  I do like the semi-repetitive pattern in it.  Also filling the frame with the shirts works very well.  It does seem like it could be just a little sharper.', '2004-09-07 10:01:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(897159, 102518, 9089, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture.  sky does seem a bit fake to me, don''t really know why, did you do some extensive burning on it?  The other thing that seems to distract from the photo to me is that one vertical light toward the left of the photo, seems to be such a harsh break between light and dark, and so it continually draws my eye from the rest of the beautiful picture.</td>', 'Beautiful picture.  sky does seem a bit fake to me, don''t really know why, did you do some extensive burning on it?  The other thing that seems to distract from the photo to me is that one vertical light toward the left of the photo, seems to be such a harsh break between light and dark, and so it continually draws my eye from the rest of the beautiful picture.', '2004-09-07 10:04:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(897161, 102738, 9089, '<td valign="top">The colors in this picture are just beautiful.  Great capture.  You may get docked for it being soft, but I think it is almost perfect.</td>', 'The colors in this picture are just beautiful.  Great capture.  You may get docked for it being soft, but I think it is almost perfect.', '2004-09-07 10:05:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(897162, 103086, 9089, '<td valign="top">Good colors on this capture.  The blowouts on the signs/lights is a shame, but is totally understandable with the capture.  I do think the exposure is spot on for the field.</td>', 'Good colors on this capture.  The blowouts on the signs/lights is a shame, but is totally understandable with the capture.  I do think the exposure is spot on for the field.', '2004-09-07 10:07:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(897164, 102812, 9089, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture.  The pastels in the picture really make it seem to be so inviting.  Did you try to use the shadows in PS to bring up some of the colors of the flowers in the foreground?  Would love to see those yellows be bright.  However, I still love the picture.</td>', 'Beautiful picture.  The pastels in the picture really make it seem to be so inviting.  Did you try to use the shadows in PS to bring up some of the colors of the flowers in the foreground?  Would love to see those yellows be bright.  However, I still love the picture.', '2004-09-07 10:10:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(897166, 102295, 9089, '<td valign="top">Picture has moved from the realm of photography.  Too little detail in the photo.  I know it is what you were trying for, but the biggest detractor is that yellow shape over their shoulders, I spend too much time thinking it is a big kite that has landed on them.  Or maybe some kind of Pterodactyl.</td>', 'Picture has moved from the realm of photography.  Too little detail in the photo.  I know it is what you were trying for, but the biggest detractor is that yellow shape over their shoulders, I spend too much time thinking it is a big kite that has landed on them.  Or maybe some kind of Pterodactyl.', '2004-09-07 10:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(897167, 103244, 9089, '<td valign="top">It is a very interesting sign, but as it is only a sign, there is nothing in the picture to keep my interest.  If you would include something to give me a little context/more information would really make this picture jump in the score.</td>', 'It is a very interesting sign, but as it is only a sign, there is nothing in the picture to keep my interest.  If you would include something to give me a little context/more information would really make this picture jump in the score.', '2004-09-07 10:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(897171, 101592, 9089, '<td valign="top">You knew you were going to be hammered when you entered this photo.  Although it is a good photo of the moon, I could not see it in a travel book.  The yellow halo around the bottom keeps distracting me, as does the graininess.</td>', 'You knew you were going to be hammered when you entered this photo.  Although it is a good photo of the moon, I could not see it in a travel book.  The yellow halo around the bottom keeps distracting me, as does the graininess.', '2004-09-07 10:18:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(897174, 103239, 9089, '<td valign="top">I hope your feelings aren''t going to be hurt too much by your score, but this one does not speak to me at all.  Blurry, composition, nothing of real interest all tend to detract from the photo.</td>', 'I hope your feelings aren''t going to be hurt too much by your score, but this one does not speak to me at all.  Blurry, composition, nothing of real interest all tend to detract from the photo.', '2004-09-07 10:19:26.000000', NULL, 1),
