(899503, 102936, 26518, '<td valign="top">The angle is off on the horse and he has a hot spot on his back, the rest of the photo is good.  Love the cabin!</td>', 'The angle is off on the horse and he has a hot spot on his back, the rest of the photo is good.  Love the cabin!', '2004-09-08 08:36:10.000000', NULL, 1),
