(899550, 102785, 26518, '<td valign="top">This is a personal feeling but I don''t like the lights.  The silhouette is good, background sky is good.</td>', 'This is a personal feeling but I don''t like the lights.  The silhouette is good, background sky is good.', '2004-09-08 09:16:18.000000', NULL, 1),
