(900723, 102508, 19608, '<td valign="top">I''m jealous - was there four days in June, and it was rainy/very cloudy the whole time.  But - they said COS was in a serious droght so I didn''t complain.  Nice scenic, well composed and exposed.</td>', 'I''m jealous - was there four days in June, and it was rainy/very cloudy the whole time.  But - they said COS was in a serious droght so I didn''t complain.  Nice scenic, well composed and exposed.', '2004-09-08 20:55:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(900726, 103211, 25042, '<td valign="top">The composition on this photo is great, but it looks a bit over exposed.</td>', 'The composition on this photo is great, but it looks a bit over exposed.', '2004-09-08 20:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(900729, 102979, 19608, '<td valign="top">Peaceful, nice colors.  Not much exciting going on.</td>', 'Peaceful, nice colors.  Not much exciting going on.', '2004-09-08 20:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(900730, 103240, 25042, '<td valign="top">The water color contrasts very well with the sunset. Nice picutre.</td>', 'The water color contrasts very well with the sunset. Nice picutre.', '2004-09-08 20:56:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(900732, 103003, 25042, '<td valign="top">I like the boarder it really birngs out the color of the wood on the building.</td>', 'I like the boarder it really birngs out the color of the wood on the building.', '2004-09-08 20:57:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(900736, 102248, 25042, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of this photo, its taken at a very interesting angle.</td>', 'I like the composition of this photo, its taken at a very interesting angle.', '2004-09-08 20:58:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(900739, 103223, 25042, '<td valign="top">Colors in the bakc ground of this photo look a bit washed out. It also might help to crop out the observation deck in the fore ground it seems to distract my attention from the falls a bit. I like the composition of your photo and the angle it was taken from.</td>', 'Colors in the bakc ground of this photo look a bit washed out. It also might help to crop out the observation deck in the fore ground it seems to distract my attention from the falls a bit. I like the composition of your photo and the angle it was taken from.', '2004-09-08 21:00:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(900742, 102246, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice composition - taken an the optimum time of day.  Strong candidate for a travel guide.</td>', 'Nice composition - taken an the optimum time of day.  Strong candidate for a travel guide.', '2004-09-08 21:02:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(900743, 103156, 25042, '<td valign="top">The buliding seems to have nice rich colors to it but the photo dosnt quite seem to bring them out .The compistion is very good and the buliding itself looks very interesting.</td>', 'The buliding seems to have nice rich colors to it but the photo dosnt quite seem to bring them out .The compistion is very good and the buliding itself looks very interesting.', '2004-09-08 21:03:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(900745, 103084, 25042, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo. I like the refection of the sky in the windows.</td>', 'Beautiful photo. I like the refection of the sky in the windows.', '2004-09-08 21:03:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(900747, 103239, 25042, '<td valign="top">The photo looks a bit grainy and over exposed.</td>', 'The photo looks a bit grainy and over exposed.', '2004-09-08 21:04:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(900748, 101801, 25042, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, great composition.</td>', 'Nice photo, great composition.', '2004-09-08 21:05:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(900750, 102738, 25042, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors. Great shot.</td>', 'Beautiful colors. Great shot.', '2004-09-08 21:05:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(900755, 102987, 25042, '<td valign="top">Looks a bit grainy and faded. A lower ISO value might help.</td>', 'Looks a bit grainy and faded. A lower ISO value might help.', '2004-09-08 21:08:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(900762, 102808, 19608, '<td valign="top">Wonderful sky!  The roofline is very nice too, but I''d like to see a bit more detail towards the bottom.</td>', 'Wonderful sky!  The roofline is very nice too, but I''d like to see a bit more detail towards the bottom.', '2004-09-08 21:10:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(900763, 103250, 25042, '<td valign="top">The tops of the buildings are not very level a rotate and crop would help this. I like the staturation and color of the course.</td>', 'The tops of the buildings are not very level a rotate and crop would help this. I like the staturation and color of the course.', '2004-09-08 21:13:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(900770, 101801, 19608, '<td valign="top">Lots of WOW due to incredible lighting!  Perfect composition with the horizon and wind sailer.  Great sky.  There''s  nothing I would suggest to improve this image (which is rare indeed for me.)</td>', 'Lots of WOW due to incredible lighting!  Perfect composition with the horizon and wind sailer.  Great sky.  There''s  nothing I would suggest to improve this image (which is rare indeed for me.)', '2004-09-08 21:21:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(900773, 102521, 19608, '<td valign="top">You picked a great time of day for this overall nice scenic. Nicely done indeed.</td>', 'You picked a great time of day for this overall nice scenic. Nicely done indeed.', '2004-09-08 21:23:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(900775, 103160, 25042, '<td valign="top">Dont know if this photo would make me want to go to NYC. But the photo it self is a great photo. Very well done. Great job.</td>', 'Dont know if this photo would make me want to go to NYC. But the photo it self is a great photo. Very well done. Great job.', '2004-09-08 21:23:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(900780, 103262, 19608, '<td valign="top">Wonderful highly saturated colors in a superb scenic.  Placement of the tree is great as was your use of some fill flash (I assume.)</td>', 'Wonderful highly saturated colors in a superb scenic.  Placement of the tree is great as was your use of some fill flash (I assume.)', '2004-09-08 21:26:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(900798, 103224, 22046, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite in the competition. Love the colors and the angles. Good one!</td>', 'This is my favorite in the competition. Love the colors and the angles. Good one!', '2004-09-08 21:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(900806, 102123, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice leading lines - right to the center of interest.  Your choice of sepia just right for this historical place.</td>', 'Nice leading lines - right to the center of interest.  Your choice of sepia just right for this historical place.', '2004-09-08 21:33:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(900807, 101658, 22046, '<td valign="top">There were several pictures of Seattle in this challenge and yours was the best. I like that you got Mount Rainier in the picture with the space needle in a balaced way. Good color too.</td>', 'There were several pictures of Seattle in this challenge and yours was the best. I like that you got Mount Rainier in the picture with the space needle in a balaced way. Good color too.', '2004-09-08 21:33:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(900811, 102258, 19608, '<td valign="top">Good capture - interesting composition, nice colors.</td>', 'Good capture - interesting composition, nice colors.', '2004-09-08 21:34:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(900813, 103063, 22046, '<td valign="top">I like the stark feeling this gives. The shapes of the church in light make this an abstract, more than just a record of the church. I can see this in an elegant brochure about your city.</td>', 'I like the stark feeling this gives. The shapes of the church in light make this an abstract, more than just a record of the church. I can see this in an elegant brochure about your city.', '2004-09-08 21:35:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(900817, 102666, 22046, '<td valign="top">Yes, I could see this in a brochure about Paradise Park. The colors and shapes are wonderful.</td>', 'Yes, I could see this in a brochure about Paradise Park. The colors and shapes are wonderful.', '2004-09-08 21:36:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(900822, 102987, 22046, '<td valign="top">I think this could use a better title. Where is this? The photo is really nice.</td>', 'I think this could use a better title. Where is this? The photo is really nice.', '2004-09-08 21:36:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(900825, 102812, 22046, '<td valign="top">Wow, what an effect! I''d love to see something like this myself. Good catch.</td>', 'Wow, what an effect! I''d love to see something like this myself. Good catch.', '2004-09-08 21:37:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(900832, 102741, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice lines and repeating shapes.  I really like the pastel colrs - very calming.</td>', 'Nice lines and repeating shapes.  I really like the pastel colrs - very calming.', '2004-09-08 21:39:02.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(900834, 102676, 22046, '<td valign="top">Where is this? Your picture does a great job of capturing this wonderful sculpture and I can see it in a brochure. I''m still wondering what city it is advertising...</td>', 'Where is this? Your picture does a great job of capturing this wonderful sculpture and I can see it in a brochure. I''m still wondering what city it is advertising...', '2004-09-08 21:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(900858, 103265, 16493, '<td valign="top">very good reflection, good night shot. Moon adds a nice touch.</td>', 'very good reflection, good night shot. Moon adds a nice touch.', '2004-09-08 21:46:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(900861, 101995, 16493, '<td valign="top">bit tight on the right but very good.</td>', 'bit tight on the right but very good.', '2004-09-08 21:47:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(900870, 103048, 16493, '<td valign="top">dont like the tilt else very good.</td>', 'dont like the tilt else very good.', '2004-09-08 21:53:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(900897, 102741, 15920, '<td valign="top">This is my pick for the challenge.  I think what makes it is the composition, the near windmill being in sharp focus compared against the far windmills with the rough reflections.  A "very well done" and a  9 from me.</td>', 'This is my pick for the challenge.  I think what makes it is the composition, the near windmill being in sharp focus compared against the far windmills with the rough reflections.  A "very well done" and a  9 from me.', '2004-09-08 22:06:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(900900, 103064, 15920, '<td valign="top">This is a really well done product shot that I just couldn''t conceive of being in a travel guide.  That said, I wish I could get silver product shots to look this good.</td>', 'This is a really well done product shot that I just couldn''t conceive of being in a travel guide.  That said, I wish I could get silver product shots to look this good.', '2004-09-08 22:08:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(901250, 103074, 6349, '<td valign="top">Brilliant composition.  I must start remembering that I want square compositions when I''m actually taking the photo.  Thanks for the reminder.  10</td>', 'Brilliant composition.  I must start remembering that I want square compositions when I''m actually taking the photo.  Thanks for the reminder.  10', '2004-09-09 01:14:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(901284, 103244, 18505, '<td valign="top">Great concept and title.  The only thing I can think of to improve it, would be to include a glimpse of Harry Potter (or Hagrid''s shadow).  10.</td>', 'Great concept and title.  The only thing I can think of to improve it, would be to include a glimpse of Harry Potter (or Hagrid''s shadow).  10.', '2004-09-09 01:48:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(901287, 101995, 18505, '<td valign="top">Perfect! 10.</td>', 'Perfect! 10.', '2004-09-09 01:50:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(901291, 103262, 18505, '<td valign="top">Incredible color.  Lovely capture.  10 from me.</td>', 'Incredible color.  Lovely capture.  10 from me.', '2004-09-09 01:52:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(901295, 102246, 18505, '<td valign="top">I was there when they were building this.  Thanks for the memories... 10.</td>', 'I was there when they were building this.  Thanks for the memories... 10.', '2004-09-09 01:54:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(901312, 102322, 18505, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image.  10.</td>', 'Beautiful image.  10.', '2004-09-09 02:12:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(901338, 103003, 25464, '<td valign="top">I could see this with a ribbon with a little color adjustment.  Nice.</td>', 'I could see this with a ribbon with a little color adjustment.  Nice.', '2004-09-09 02:39:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(901576, 102677, 7560, '<td valign="top">Rainbow filter or excellent capture? Either way, a fab, strong image. Excellent color, great lighting. Right now a 9. May go up on the final round of voting. :)</td>', 'Rainbow filter or excellent capture? Either way, a fab, strong image. Excellent color, great lighting. Right now a 9. May go up on the final round of voting. :)', '2004-09-09 08:38:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(901604, 103223, 24666, '<td valign="top">Love this picture , captures the insignificance of man against mother nature</td>', 'Love this picture , captures the insignificance of man against mother nature', '2004-09-09 09:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(901611, 102124, 24666, '<td valign="top">Nice picture , low on colour but hifh on effectiveness</td>', 'Nice picture , low on colour but hifh on effectiveness', '2004-09-09 09:48:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(901622, 102653, 8367, '<td valign="top">Nice photo. I like how the dock, boats and clouds lead the viewer through the photo. IMHO, it could be improved by rotating clockwise slightly to level the horizon and cropping off the left side to the edge of the dock. I find the tree trunk on the left overpowering the photo and disrupting the flow...</td>', 'Nice photo. I like how the dock, boats and clouds lead the viewer through the photo. IMHO, it could be improved by rotating clockwise slightly to level the horizon and cropping off the left side to the edge of the dock. I find the tree trunk on the left overpowering the photo and disrupting the flow...', '2004-09-09 10:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(901627, 102973, 26115, '<td valign="top">lovely picture :) only thing i may consider is cloning out the shaddow on the dirt road? though thats more a personal feeling<br/></td>', 'lovely picture :) only thing i may consider is cloning out the shaddow on the dirt road? though thats more a personal feeling', '2004-09-09 10:19:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(901657, 103042, 13136, '<td valign="top">Impact would be much better if the angle was with sun to your back to bring out the balloon colors.</td>', 'Impact would be much better if the angle was with sun to your back to bring out the balloon colors.', '2004-09-09 10:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(901711, 102248, 8610, '<td valign="top">So I am about 2776 miles from ya right now :D. Little to dark, but I think it would be hard to take this picture with good brightnes, without sem good and strong lights.  Nice try - 7</td>', 'So I am about 2776 miles from ya right now :D. Little to dark, but I think it would be hard to take this picture with good brightnes, without sem good and strong lights.  Nice try - 7', '2004-09-09 11:39:53.000000', NULL, 1),
