(901917, 102350, 24613, '<td valign="top">Very, Very nice!!  My favorite - back to change from 9 to 10.  Light and color are great!!</td>', 'Very, Very nice!!  My favorite - back to change from 9 to 10.  Light and color are great!!', '2004-09-09 14:47:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(901944, 102126, 20115, '<td valign="top">Just beautiful--wish I was there.</td>', 'Just beautiful--wish I was there.', '2004-09-09 15:18:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(901954, 103263, 20115, '<td valign="top">Never saw this before--Oregon right?  Learning so much about different places.  Beautiful.</td>', 'Never saw this before--Oregon right?  Learning so much about different places.  Beautiful.', '2004-09-09 15:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(901959, 103241, 20115, '<td valign="top">Oh Wow--my partner is part Shinnecock.  Can you send me info about the Pow Wow.  Thanks.  I atted a July 4th Pow Wow in Lame Deer, MT last year and loved it.  Nice photo--love the glasses.</td>', 'Oh Wow--my partner is part Shinnecock.  Can you send me info about the Pow Wow.  Thanks.  I atted a July 4th Pow Wow in Lame Deer, MT last year and loved it.  Nice photo--love the glasses.', '2004-09-09 15:23:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(901962, 102123, 20115, '<td valign="top">Nice touch with the sepia.</td>', 'Nice touch with the sepia.', '2004-09-09 15:24:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(901980, 102812, 20115, '<td valign="top">Wow--beautiful shot.</td>', 'Wow--beautiful shot.', '2004-09-09 15:33:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(902053, 102447, 8860, '<td valign="top">This is an adequate shot but not particularly captivating. It''s a nice time of day but you have underexposed areas which look a little heavy. Some sensitive dodge and burn would have been appropriate here - as well as some more time spent proof reading your title!</td>', 'This is an adequate shot but not particularly captivating. It''s a nice time of day but you have underexposed areas which look a little heavy. Some sensitive dodge and burn would have been appropriate here - as well as some more time spent proof reading your title!', '2004-09-09 16:32:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(902056, 103198, 8860, '<td valign="top">This shot holds little appeal for me I''m afraid. The subject has her back turned on the viewer which immediately puts up a barrier. This coupled with the railing and quite a bland, colourless scene beyond renders the shot quite inert.<br/> <br/>If she had been standing turned 3/4 of the way towards us looking out to the water''s edge beyond it would have led the eye into the shot. You had some quite bright light here so I would have stopped down a bit to around f6-8, focused 2/3 out thus attaining some richer tones and longer DOF. At the moment all we have to look at is her well focused back!<br/> <br/>Sorry not to be more positive.</td>', 'This shot holds little appeal for me I''m afraid. The subject has her back turned on the viewer which immediately puts up a barrier. This coupled with the railing and quite a bland, colourless scene beyond renders the shot quite inert. If she had been standing turned 3/4 of the way towards us looking out to the water''s edge beyond it would have led the eye into the shot. You had some quite bright light here so I would have stopped down a bit to around f6-8, focused 2/3 out thus attaining some richer tones and longer DOF. At the moment all we have to look at is her well focused back! Sorry not to be more positive.', '2004-09-09 16:36:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(902059, 102892, 24715, '<td valign="top">Nice pic, but I feel like falling over.. ouch ;-)</td>', 'Nice pic, but I feel like falling over.. ouch ;-)', '2004-09-09 16:39:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(902062, 101995, 24715, '<td valign="top">Very cool picture, excellent focus, color and contrast. I''d never think place like this existed in the Rockies.</td>', 'Very cool picture, excellent focus, color and contrast. I''d never think place like this existed in the Rockies.', '2004-09-09 16:41:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(902067, 102007, 24715, '<td valign="top">I''d lighten up that dark cloud on the top of the picture to make it even better! Good job nonetheless!</td>', 'I''d lighten up that dark cloud on the top of the picture to make it even better! Good job nonetheless!', '2004-09-09 16:45:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(902082, 102322, 23653, '<td valign="top">I love this chuch it is beautiful, I see it every day as I work by it..  Lighting could be better in this shot.</td>', 'I love this chuch it is beautiful, I see it every day as I work by it..  Lighting could be better in this shot.', '2004-09-09 16:59:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(902159, 101884, 19959, '<td valign="top">Have you thougt of going in for ''wildlife photographer of the year'' ??<br/>Excellent...</td>', 'Have you thougt of going in for ''wildlife photographer of the year'' ??Excellent...', '2004-09-09 18:00:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(902168, 102904, 19959, '<td valign="top">excellent.</td>', 'excellent.', '2004-09-09 18:03:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(902182, 103015, 19982, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting!  Good luck on the challenge.</td>', 'Excellent lighting!  Good luck on the challenge.', '2004-09-09 18:18:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(902185, 103154, 19982, '<td valign="top">I really like the lighting in this photo.  Good luck on the challenge!</td>', 'I really like the lighting in this photo.  Good luck on the challenge!', '2004-09-09 18:21:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(902187, 103265, 19982, '<td valign="top">The lighting and the sharpness are great.  I love the reflection on the pool.  Good luck on the challenge!</td>', 'The lighting and the sharpness are great.  I love the reflection on the pool.  Good luck on the challenge!', '2004-09-09 18:23:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(902188, 102416, 19982, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sunset.  Exposed perfectly.  Love the textures in the sky and in the water.  The diagonal made by the pier is placed just perfect.  Good luck on the challenge!</td>', 'Beautiful sunset.  Exposed perfectly.  Love the textures in the sky and in the water.  The diagonal made by the pier is placed just perfect.  Good luck on the challenge!', '2004-09-09 18:24:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(902191, 102350, 19982, '<td valign="top">Wow... love the colors and the reflection on the water.  This must have been a long exposure.  The sharpness is really good as are the textures in the walls and the buildings.  Good luck on the challenge!</td>', 'Wow... love the colors and the reflection on the water.  This must have been a long exposure.  The sharpness is really good as are the textures in the walls and the buildings.  Good luck on the challenge!', '2004-09-09 18:25:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(902194, 103141, 19982, '<td valign="top">Great timing, you''ve got an awesome sunset there.  I wish the memorial was just a tad sharper.  And I bet you''ll get a few negative comments on the border (me, I think it''s fine ... if anything maybe just a tad too thick, but others I''m sure will complain).  Good luck on the challenge!</td>', 'Great timing, you''ve got an awesome sunset there.  I wish the memorial was just a tad sharper.  And I bet you''ll get a few negative comments on the border (me, I think it''s fine ... if anything maybe just a tad too thick, but others I''m sure will complain).  Good luck on the challenge!', '2004-09-09 18:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(902196, 102904, 19982, '<td valign="top">Looks like some dodging going on, what with the hallows around the subject.  Otherwise, excellent lighting.  Good luck on the challenge!</td>', 'Looks like some dodging going on, what with the hallows around the subject.  Otherwise, excellent lighting.  Good luck on the challenge!', '2004-09-09 18:28:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(902200, 103152, 19982, '<td valign="top">This one might be improved with a little tighter shot to help get the viewer "in" on the action.  Good luck on the challenge!</td>', 'This one might be improved with a little tighter shot to help get the viewer "in" on the action.  Good luck on the challenge!', '2004-09-09 18:29:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(902207, 102700, 19982, '<td valign="top">Hey, I think this one belongs in the Framing challenge! :-)  Good luck!</td>', 'Hey, I think this one belongs in the Framing challenge! :-)  Good luck!', '2004-09-09 18:32:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(902211, 103164, 19982, '<td valign="top">I think the human element really adds to this photo.  Good luck on the challenge!</td>', 'I think the human element really adds to this photo.  Good luck on the challenge!', '2004-09-09 18:33:42.000000', NULL, 1),
