(902249, 103239, 19982, '<td valign="top">I think you missed the focus on this one...  The one thing that might be in focus is the head of the cow on the left.  Everything else looks really soft to me.</td>', 'I think you missed the focus on this one...  The one thing that might be in focus is the head of the cow on the left.  Everything else looks really soft to me.', '2004-09-09 18:59:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(902260, 103263, 26655, '<td valign="top">displays peacefulness incredibly...something a travel book would definitely put inside</td>', 'displays peacefulness incredibly...something a travel book would definitely put inside', '2004-09-09 19:10:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(902267, 103245, 19982, '<td valign="top">It might have been nice to crop the guy out on the left... but then, that would break one of the basic rules of "leave the subject with someplace to go" and since he is moving towards the left, you do need space on the left.  Anyway, such is life...  maybe another shot in the same location might have been more perfect.</td>', 'It might have been nice to crop the guy out on the left... but then, that would break one of the basic rules of "leave the subject with someplace to go" and since he is moving towards the left, you do need space on the left.  Anyway, such is life...  maybe another shot in the same location might have been more perfect.', '2004-09-09 19:12:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(902281, 102973, 16636, '<td valign="top">great image and the colours are very vibrant, good luck</td>', 'great image and the colours are very vibrant, good luck', '2004-09-09 19:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(902338, 102700, 11895, '<td valign="top">too much black, not enough of the subject</td>', 'too much black, not enough of the subject', '2004-09-09 20:09:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(902371, 102887, 3328, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo. The gradiant color change of the base of the pillars accents that of the sand to the water. My only negatice comment (other than that bird in the water) is that my eyes beg for just a few more inches of the pier up top.</td>', 'I really like this photo. The gradiant color change of the base of the pillars accents that of the sand to the water. My only negatice comment (other than that bird in the water) is that my eyes beg for just a few more inches of the pier up top.', '2004-09-09 20:26:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(902374, 103212, 23338, '<td valign="top">There are certain subjects that, unless photographed with specific light and very fine detail, tend to look muddy.  The sides of buildings made from adobe, some smooth, light-colored rocks, slime buildups in caves - all of those qualify.  That is the situation in this case.   I''d love to see lots more definition, focus, detail or whatever.  Everything just looks so soft on my screen.</td>', 'There are certain subjects that, unless photographed with specific light and very fine detail, tend to look muddy.  The sides of buildings made from adobe, some smooth, light-colored rocks, slime buildups in caves - all of those qualify.  That is the situation in this case.   I''d love to see lots more definition, focus, detail or whatever.  Everything just looks so soft on my screen.', '2004-09-09 20:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(902379, 103238, 23338, '<td valign="top">I want tickets to a known destination.  And, if I had to guess, this is an apartment complex in some suburb.</td>', 'I want tickets to a known destination.  And, if I had to guess, this is an apartment complex in some suburb.', '2004-09-09 20:30:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(902392, 101801, 23338, '<td valign="top">This is an absolutely beautiful image.  As a photograph for a travel guide, what is there to do?  Who goes there?  Where is it?  I would have rated it higher except it doesn''t answer any of those questions.  A perfect 10, IMHO, would.</td>', 'This is an absolutely beautiful image.  As a photograph for a travel guide, what is there to do?  Who goes there?  Where is it?  I would have rated it higher except it doesn''t answer any of those questions.  A perfect 10, IMHO, would.', '2004-09-09 20:33:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(902396, 102258, 23338, '<td valign="top">Very nice image.  Recognizable as to local.  People included with activities for them.  Makes me want to visit.  IMHO, all those things are required for a 10 in this challenge.</td>', 'Very nice image.  Recognizable as to local.  People included with activities for them.  Makes me want to visit.  IMHO, all those things are required for a 10 in this challenge.', '2004-09-09 20:35:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(902409, 102350, 23338, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, nicely lit image.   Very interesting local.  Looks like lots of activities.  Makes me want to visit.</td>', 'Beautiful, nicely lit image.   Very interesting local.  Looks like lots of activities.  Makes me want to visit.', '2004-09-09 20:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(902426, 102816, 23338, '<td valign="top">There''s a story here; probably based on very interesting history.  There are water activities galore; beautiful surface reflections; nice water craft; lots of outside activities.  This image, with such clear details and bright contrasts, really makes me want to visit.  Congratulations.</td>', 'There''s a story here; probably based on very interesting history.  There are water activities galore; beautiful surface reflections; nice water craft; lots of outside activities.  This image, with such clear details and bright contrasts, really makes me want to visit.  Congratulations.', '2004-09-09 20:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(902435, 102676, 23338, '<td valign="top">I really like the beautiful Viking sculpture and the way the photograph portrays the contrasting colors, lighting and reflections.  It makes me think that there are whole parts of the world that I know nothing about.  Maybe I should visit there.  Nicely done.</td>', 'I really like the beautiful Viking sculpture and the way the photograph portrays the contrasting colors, lighting and reflections.  It makes me think that there are whole parts of the world that I know nothing about.  Maybe I should visit there.  Nicely done.', '2004-09-09 20:53:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(902437, 102447, 6999, '<td valign="top">Man, this is a cut-their-head-off photo. It really really looks like you''ve simply missed, and have included too much at the bottom of frame and not enough at the top. There is absolutely nothing of interest in that bottom section - even if those reflections were a strong point, there is still enough of them in the rest of the shot. cutting off the mast like that just feels like a mistake. Ceentred horizon is just very very weak visually. exposure and colours are excellent though.</td>', 'Man, this is a cut-their-head-off photo. It really really looks like you''ve simply missed, and have included too much at the bottom of frame and not enough at the top. There is absolutely nothing of interest in that bottom section - even if those reflections were a strong point, there is still enough of them in the rest of the shot. cutting off the mast like that just feels like a mistake. Ceentred horizon is just very very weak visually. exposure and colours are excellent though.', '2004-09-09 20:55:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(902444, 102518, 23338, '<td valign="top">Absolutely stunning image.  Must be nice feeling to have taken it.  I would have given it a higher rating, but I was looking for also for additional visual information about people, activities, events, etc.   You''ll probably get lots of 10s though, and as an image alone, it deserves them.  Congratulations.</td>', 'Absolutely stunning image.  Must be nice feeling to have taken it.  I would have given it a higher rating, but I was looking for also for additional visual information about people, activities, events, etc.   You''ll probably get lots of 10s though, and as an image alone, it deserves them.  Congratulations.', '2004-09-09 20:57:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(902459, 101995, 23338, '<td valign="top">Neat juxtaposition of sunset and moonrise - or vice versey.  Love the image.  Would it have been possible to dodge the left and right of the building to get more of the lighting effect?  Might not be necessary, but could have shown even more detail in the building.  Anyway, still love the image.  Congratulations.</td>', 'Neat juxtaposition of sunset and moonrise - or vice versey.  Love the image.  Would it have been possible to dodge the left and right of the building to get more of the lighting effect?  Might not be necessary, but could have shown even more detail in the building.  Anyway, still love the image.  Congratulations.', '2004-09-09 21:03:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(902464, 103141, 23338, '<td valign="top">Really nice image; spectacular sunset.  Hmmm...  is DC really about the scenery and weather?   Most images would have shown the sitting Lincoln figure all lit up ...  Maybe the DC C of C should think about YOUR viewpoint once in awhile.  Might take the dirty politics out of everyone''s mental thought processes when thinking about traveling to Washinton - there ARE lots of historical and artistic attractions.   Congratulations on a really nice image.</td>', 'Really nice image; spectacular sunset.  Hmmm...  is DC really about the scenery and weather?   Most images would have shown the sitting Lincoln figure all lit up ...  Maybe the DC C of C should think about YOUR viewpoint once in awhile.  Might take the dirty politics out of everyone''s mental thought processes when thinking about traveling to Washinton - there ARE lots of historical and artistic attractions.   Congratulations on a really nice image.', '2004-09-09 21:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(902466, 103064, 23338, '<td valign="top">It''s a COMPASS!  (Albeit, a nicely done one.)  Doesn''t tell me anything about a specific location to visit - would apply to ALL of them.   Unless, maybe, the travel guide was highlighting local businesses and Eddie Bauer''s HQ was there.   :-)</td>', 'It''s a COMPASS!  (Albeit, a nicely done one.)  Doesn''t tell me anything about a specific location to visit - would apply to ALL of them.   Unless, maybe, the travel guide was highlighting local businesses and Eddie Bauer''s HQ was there.   :-)', '2004-09-09 21:11:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(902469, 102999, 23338, '<td valign="top">Sending people into Florida this week would not be a profitable business, unless you worked for the Red Cross or the National Guard.  Residence there probably are going to want a totally different kind of image in the travel guide...</td>', 'Sending people into Florida this week would not be a profitable business, unless you worked for the Red Cross or the National Guard.  Residence there probably are going to want a totally different kind of image in the travel guide...', '2004-09-09 21:13:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(902474, 102435, 23338, '<td valign="top">Sorry.  This doesn''t look like a place I''d like to visit.  If there WAS an attraction that sported this individual as their main model, I''d probably try to portray it in an image with more of the surroundings - to put it into perspective - rather than making it so sinister.</td>', 'Sorry.  This doesn''t look like a place I''d like to visit.  If there WAS an attraction that sported this individual as their main model, I''d probably try to portray it in an image with more of the surroundings - to put it into perspective - rather than making it so sinister.', '2004-09-09 21:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(902477, 101592, 23338, '<td valign="top">Nice image for a brochure about a night at the observatory.  Probably not too realistic as a true travel destination.  Fortunately, probably not everyone rates as drastically as I do for "truth in advertising".  Good luck with it.</td>', 'Nice image for a brochure about a night at the observatory.  Probably not too realistic as a true travel destination.  Fortunately, probably not everyone rates as drastically as I do for "truth in advertising".  Good luck with it.', '2004-09-09 21:19:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(902482, 102902, 23338, '<td valign="top">Although it is a realtive nice water reflection image, it just doesn''t tell me much about the area and its attractions, its culture, people, history, etc.  I would have tried to include more visual information about activities (boats, swans, people, historical buildings - if available, etc.).  Good luck with it.</td>', 'Although it is a realtive nice water reflection image, it just doesn''t tell me much about the area and its attractions, its culture, people, history, etc.  I would have tried to include more visual information about activities (boats, swans, people, historical buildings - if available, etc.).  Good luck with it.', '2004-09-09 21:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(902553, 101658, 23338, '<td valign="top">This is by far the best Seattle image in the challenge - and probably the best "any city" image.  DOF to infinity.  Great contrast between tower and mountain (and even the skyline composition is cool).   Would do wonderful as the front cover of a travel guide for the area.  It would attract me, that''s for sure.  As an overall travel image, it would have to be supplemented by people and activities.   If I rated higher for other images, it was because they also included those items.  Congratulations.</td>', 'This is by far the best Seattle image in the challenge - and probably the best "any city" image.  DOF to infinity.  Great contrast between tower and mountain (and even the skyline composition is cool).   Would do wonderful as the front cover of a travel guide for the area.  It would attract me, that''s for sure.  As an overall travel image, it would have to be supplemented by people and activities.   If I rated higher for other images, it was because they also included those items.  Congratulations.', '2004-09-09 21:57:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(902564, 101884, 23338, '<td valign="top">Really nice image of the bird.  Great colors, detail, contrast with back ground, watchful little eye peering at you.  Unfortunately, it would just as well be Chicago, Phoenix, NYC, Miami (probably more so, considering all their plastic ones), San Diego, etc.  IMHO, the image needs to say something about a "particular" location.  Others probably won''t agree with me.  Good luck with it.</td>', 'Really nice image of the bird.  Great colors, detail, contrast with back ground, watchful little eye peering at you.  Unfortunately, it would just as well be Chicago, Phoenix, NYC, Miami (probably more so, considering all their plastic ones), San Diego, etc.  IMHO, the image needs to say something about a "particular" location.  Others probably won''t agree with me.  Good luck with it.', '2004-09-09 22:01:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(902569, 102666, 8054, '<td valign="top">Amazingly sharp details. Excellent color and contrast. I wish there was some sort of background to place the bird, so to speak. Right now I see a black background vs some sort of habitat.</td>', 'Amazingly sharp details. Excellent color and contrast. I wish there was some sort of background to place the bird, so to speak. Right now I see a black background vs some sort of habitat.', '2004-09-09 22:03:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(902575, 103247, 23338, '<td valign="top">Man, there is NOTHING more boring to me when traveling than flat, on-going for ever, monotonous, straight highways.  I would NEVER try and put them in a travel guide designed to entice visitors.  Nice clouds though - and good contrast.  Good luck with it in the challenge.</td>', 'Man, there is NOTHING more boring to me when traveling than flat, on-going for ever, monotonous, straight highways.  I would NEVER try and put them in a travel guide designed to entice visitors.  Nice clouds though - and good contrast.  Good luck with it in the challenge.', '2004-09-09 22:05:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(902582, 102427, 8054, '<td valign="top">No idea what this is but it''s pretty cool. Great night photo. Sky is a nice hue of blue. The op of the tower is almost overexposed but overall not bad.</td>', 'No idea what this is but it''s pretty cool. Great night photo. Sky is a nice hue of blue. The op of the tower is almost overexposed but overall not bad.', '2004-09-09 22:08:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(902584, 103244, 23338, '<td valign="top">I like the detail that shows in the top 1/3 of the image, but it''s lacking in the rest.  As for a travel guide, unless you were going for a book tour, this image would only be one of multiples that showed local activities.  It wouldn''t be a great, attracting, all encompassing descriptor of a travel destination which is what I was kind of looking for.  Maybe others will disagree with me.  Good luck with it.</td>', 'I like the detail that shows in the top 1/3 of the image, but it''s lacking in the rest.  As for a travel guide, unless you were going for a book tour, this image would only be one of multiples that showed local activities.  It wouldn''t be a great, attracting, all encompassing descriptor of a travel destination which is what I was kind of looking for.  Maybe others will disagree with me.  Good luck with it.', '2004-09-09 22:08:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(902587, 103015, 8054, '<td valign="top">Good skyline photo. The Space Needle is really cool. However, this photo could have been cropped a bit more off the bottom to eliminate the white-red-white thing in the lower left which is annoying. I would have lopped all the way up to just above the flag pole. That way you''d just have the skyline and clouds. And contrast could use some adjustment, too.</td>', 'Good skyline photo. The Space Needle is really cool. However, this photo could have been cropped a bit more off the bottom to eliminate the white-red-white thing in the lower left which is annoying. I would have lopped all the way up to just above the flag pole. That way you''d just have the skyline and clouds. And contrast could use some adjustment, too.', '2004-09-09 22:11:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(902599, 103236, 8054, '<td valign="top">Very nice reflections on the water and very nice symmetry. Almost feels a bit oversaturated. Great photo overall.</td>', 'Very nice reflections on the water and very nice symmetry. Almost feels a bit oversaturated. Great photo overall.', '2004-09-09 22:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(902629, 103250, 24925, '<td valign="top">Nice shot (I especially like the golf course in the foreground) but it seems to have been taken at a slight angle so that the ''horizon'' is tilted to the left...It might just be the perspective of the building.</td>', 'Nice shot (I especially like the golf course in the foreground) but it seems to have been taken at a slight angle so that the ''horizon'' is tilted to the left...It might just be the perspective of the building.', '2004-09-09 22:55:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(902636, 102741, 24925, '<td valign="top">This is definately a photo I could see in a travel guide.  I think it''s framed perfectly, though I am distracted by the grass in the bottom right corner of the frame.<br/> <br/>Also, the sky seems to be an unpleasing shade of blue...  <br/> <br/>Very nice shot, though!<br/></td>', 'This is definately a photo I could see in a travel guide.  I think it''s framed perfectly, though I am distracted by the grass in the bottom right corner of the frame. Also, the sky seems to be an unpleasing shade of blue...   Very nice shot, though!', '2004-09-09 22:58:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(902641, 102952, 24925, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure whether a picture like this in a travel guide would make me want to go to this location, but it is a nice photograph and I thank you for leaving  in the grain!</td>', 'I''m not sure whether a picture like this in a travel guide would make me want to go to this location, but it is a nice photograph and I thank you for leaving  in the grain!', '2004-09-09 23:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(902647, 102941, 24925, '<td valign="top">Nicely taken shot, although I''m not sure that the invididual in the water actually adds anything to the photograph as I can''t see what he/she is doing (by the suggestion of the title, I''m assuming it might have to do with surfing?)...<br/> <br/>I''m also not sure that this would be a great choice for a travel photo taken with the intention of drawing people to that location.<br/> <br/>I do like the photograph but I can''t consider it a great candidate for a travel brochure...</td>', 'Nicely taken shot, although I''m not sure that the invididual in the water actually adds anything to the photograph as I can''t see what he/she is doing (by the suggestion of the title, I''m assuming it might have to do with surfing?)... I''m also not sure that this would be a great choice for a travel photo taken with the intention of drawing people to that location. I do like the photograph but I can''t consider it a great candidate for a travel brochure...', '2004-09-09 23:04:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(902656, 101801, 24925, '<td valign="top">I could be wrong, but the clouds seem a little overprocessed by a possible oversaturation of blue...I don''t know what it is exactly, but something doesn''t quite look right.<br/> <br/>But let''s ignore that for a sec...a nice photograph compositionally with a neat mood to it (rainy in the background, sunny in the foreground).  I wish I could see more texture in the posts (?) and the sand, though.</td>', 'I could be wrong, but the clouds seem a little overprocessed by a possible oversaturation of blue...I don''t know what it is exactly, but something doesn''t quite look right. But let''s ignore that for a sec...a nice photograph compositionally with a neat mood to it (rainy in the background, sunny in the foreground).  I wish I could see more texture in the posts (?) and the sand, though.', '2004-09-09 23:08:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(902659, 103072, 24925, '<td valign="top">Fairly nice shot...too bad about the boring sky/lighting.  It would be nice to see this taken with a more dramatic sky.</td>', 'Fairly nice shot...too bad about the boring sky/lighting.  It would be nice to see this taken with a more dramatic sky.', '2004-09-09 23:09:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(902663, 102677, 24925, '<td valign="top">Fancy rainbow...very nice!  My wish list:<br/> <br/>I wish the annoying shadow wasn''t on the statue.<br/>I wish it was cropped just below the statue.<br/> <br/>Pretty neat, though.</td>', 'Fancy rainbow...very nice!  My wish list: I wish the annoying shadow wasn''t on the statue.I wish it was cropped just below the statue. Pretty neat, though.', '2004-09-09 23:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(902668, 102899, 24925, '<td valign="top">Happy 8 to you!  First one I''ve handed out...This is a fairly typical type of travel photo shot, but this is what the challenge is all about!<br/> <br/>I see a little bit of mist in the background and I really wish there was more in the foreground (not so much that you can''t see the island, of course)...<br/> <br/>Perhaps a narrower vertical crop, as well.<br/> <br/>Overall, pretty good!</td>', 'Happy 8 to you!  First one I''ve handed out...This is a fairly typical type of travel photo shot, but this is what the challenge is all about! I see a little bit of mist in the background and I really wish there was more in the foreground (not so much that you can''t see the island, of course)... Perhaps a narrower vertical crop, as well. Overall, pretty good!', '2004-09-09 23:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(902671, 103224, 24925, '<td valign="top">Nice shot...part of me expects to see more at the bottom and wishes it wasn''t cut off there...<br/> <br/>Good shot, and overall I think it''s well composed.</td>', 'Nice shot...part of me expects to see more at the bottom and wishes it wasn''t cut off there... Good shot, and overall I think it''s well composed.', '2004-09-09 23:16:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(902673, 101498, 24925, '<td valign="top">This is one of those excellent photographs that I would normally give an 8 or a 9, but it just doesn''t suit the challenge that well.<br/> <br/>I really can''t see a photo like this in a travel guide, because it doesn''t make me want to visit the location for a vacation.  All I really see are some trees and clouds and I have those in my backyard, you know what I mean?  But boy, do I ever like this photograph!</td>', 'This is one of those excellent photographs that I would normally give an 8 or a 9, but it just doesn''t suit the challenge that well. I really can''t see a photo like this in a travel guide, because it doesn''t make me want to visit the location for a vacation.  All I really see are some trees and clouds and I have those in my backyard, you know what I mean?  But boy, do I ever like this photograph!', '2004-09-09 23:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(902679, 102784, 24925, '<td valign="top">First of all, I''m on the verge of loving this shot...here''s what''s stopping me:<br/> <br/>Slight angle of the shot, which is most noticeable at the top of the frame.<br/>The crappy reflections on the left window.  <br/>The out of focus couple.<br/>The man''s face is cut off (are they the subject or aren''t they?)<br/>The awkward thing (sign?) behind the top of the lamp post. Could this have been cropped slightly higher?<br/> <br/>The good news is, I think I love everything else about this shot (compositionally speaking).  If this shot was retaken with the right mood/lighting and some of the above issues fixed, and if it were taken in a way so that the older couple were the subjects and it was assumed that beautiful car was theirs and they were on a date, it would get a 9.  <br/> <br/>The potential for a very nice photo is here, I hope you get another try!  Good eye!<br/></td>', 'First of all, I''m on the verge of loving this shot...here''s what''s stopping me: Slight angle of the shot, which is most noticeable at the top of the frame.The crappy reflections on the left window.  The out of focus couple.The man''s face is cut off (are they the subject or aren''t they?)The awkward thing (sign?) behind the top of the lamp post. Could this have been cropped slightly higher? The good news is, I think I love everything else about this shot (compositionally speaking).  If this shot was retaken with the right mood/lighting and some of the above issues fixed, and if it were taken in a way so that the older couple were the subjects and it was assumed that beautiful car was theirs and they were on a date, it would get a 9.   The potential for a very nice photo is here, I hope you get another try!  Good eye!', '2004-09-09 23:25:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(902681, 103141, 671, '<td valign="top">absolutely glorious! The lighting is perfect.</td>', 'absolutely glorious! The lighting is perfect.', '2004-09-09 23:27:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(902683, 102729, 671, '<td valign="top">Good choice of subject.  Not the run of the mill.  I really like this picture.</td>', 'Good choice of subject.  Not the run of the mill.  I really like this picture.', '2004-09-09 23:29:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(902842, 103211, 22686, '<td valign="top">There''s another photograph here that I didn''t like because the foreground and background seemed like 2 separate pictures - I think it was tecnically better shot than this, which seems to have some lighting difficulties - but I prefer this picture and marked it higher because it fits together much better as a picture. I just like the way all the pieces fit together. You have 2 subjects, like that other did, each separately framed, like that other did, but in yours they''re very much together, and part of the same picture.</td>', 'There''s another photograph here that I didn''t like because the foreground and background seemed like 2 separate pictures - I think it was tecnically better shot than this, which seems to have some lighting difficulties - but I prefer this picture and marked it higher because it fits together much better as a picture. I just like the way all the pieces fit together. You have 2 subjects, like that other did, each separately framed, like that other did, but in yours they''re very much together, and part of the same picture.', '2004-09-10 01:15:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(902848, 102654, 25464, '<td valign="top">Top 5 in my books.</td>', 'Top 5 in my books.', '2004-09-10 01:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
