(903761, 102648, 3102, '<td valign="top">It''s an ok attempt at a night shot, but I might have tried a couple things differently.  I might have tried exposing it a little longer to bring out a little more detail.  Shooting at dusk is a good time, too, so that there''s more detail of the buildings.</td>', 'It''s an ok attempt at a night shot, but I might have tried a couple things differently.  I might have tried exposing it a little longer to bring out a little more detail.  Shooting at dusk is a good time, too, so that there''s more detail of the buildings.', '2004-09-10 17:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(903763, 103053, 3102, '<td valign="top">I like the colors of the umbrella, but the rest of the image seems unnaturally blue to me.</td>', 'I like the colors of the umbrella, but the rest of the image seems unnaturally blue to me.', '2004-09-10 17:46:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(903764, 103193, 3102, '<td valign="top">I can''t say I''m fond of the post-processing here.  It looks like there was too much effort put into selectively blurring portions of the shot, particularly the odd glow around the fisherman.</td>', 'I can''t say I''m fond of the post-processing here.  It looks like there was too much effort put into selectively blurring portions of the shot, particularly the odd glow around the fisherman.', '2004-09-10 17:48:13.000000', NULL, 1),
