(904544, 102638, 15920, '<td valign="top">I really like this, I scored it as one of the highest images in the challenge.  It would have been my top pick if there was more light in the front (without loosing the perfect exposure on the cityscape.)  Not sure how you could do that exactly, just a thought.  Thanks for sharing this.</td>', 'I really like this, I scored it as one of the highest images in the challenge.  It would have been my top pick if there was more light in the front (without loosing the perfect exposure on the cityscape.)  Not sure how you could do that exactly, just a thought.  Thanks for sharing this.', '2004-09-11 08:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
