(904868, 102117, 19421, '<td valign="top">At first glance, this shot didn''t do much for me, but the more I look at it, the more I like it.  It really conveys a feeling of motion.  I feel the sky moving behing the birds.  Great shot!</td>', 'At first glance, this shot didn''t do much for me, but the more I look at it, the more I like it.  It really conveys a feeling of motion.  I feel the sky moving behing the birds.  Great shot!', '2004-09-11 16:41:35.000000', NULL, 1),
