(904884, 102876, 19421, '<td valign="top">Great landscape out there. Nice Shot.</td>', 'Great landscape out there. Nice Shot.', '2004-09-11 16:55:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(904886, 102282, 4517, '<td valign="top">Great view spoilt by the brick pillars.</td>', 'Great view spoilt by the brick pillars.', '2004-09-11 16:56:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(904912, 101475, 8860, '<td valign="top">Subject is OK, but the shot itself is not special or particularly engaging apart from being shot from lower than eye level. Some obvious dodging on the statue legs.</td>', 'Subject is OK, but the shot itself is not special or particularly engaging apart from being shot from lower than eye level. Some obvious dodging on the statue legs.', '2004-09-11 17:41:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(904914, 102695, 8860, '<td valign="top">The scene is alright but the shot is not particulalry inspiring and the colours a little washed out. Good composition.</td>', 'The scene is alright but the shot is not particulalry inspiring and the colours a little washed out. Good composition.', '2004-09-11 17:43:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(904918, 103102, 8860, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject and good viewpoint. This has been spoiled though only by some heavy use of dodge &amp; burn and the shad/hilite filter making it look very surreal and unbalanced.</td>', 'Interesting subject and good viewpoint. This has been spoiled though only by some heavy use of dodge & burn and the shad/hilite filter making it look very surreal and unbalanced.', '2004-09-11 17:50:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(904920, 102792, 8860, '<td valign="top">Subject not engaging - shot not very interesting viewpoint really. Sorry, but although the scene is pleasant I don''t feel that much attempt has been made with the photography to enhance what is in front of you.</td>', 'Subject not engaging - shot not very interesting viewpoint really. Sorry, but although the scene is pleasant I don''t feel that much attempt has been made with the photography to enhance what is in front of you.', '2004-09-11 17:53:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(904921, 103121, 8860, '<td valign="top">Nice detail. Plainly presented but it does the job.</td>', 'Nice detail. Plainly presented but it does the job.', '2004-09-11 17:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(904922, 102700, 8860, '<td valign="top">While an attempt at a creative viewpoint this ultimately obscures the subject from anyone wishing to come here!</td>', 'While an attempt at a creative viewpoint this ultimately obscures the subject from anyone wishing to come here!', '2004-09-11 17:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(904925, 102246, 8860, '<td valign="top">Good subject, interesting view. Colours are a bit green cast and somewhat gloomy.</td>', 'Good subject, interesting view. Colours are a bit green cast and somewhat gloomy.', '2004-09-11 17:56:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(904926, 102973, 8860, '<td valign="top">Very pleasant uplifting vibe from the shot. Well compsoed and wuite lush, but there is some noticable haloing from shad/hilite filter. Did it really need this? If so a bit more time spent to reduce the effects would have been in order.</td>', 'Very pleasant uplifting vibe from the shot. Well compsoed and wuite lush, but there is some noticable haloing from shad/hilite filter. Did it really need this? If so a bit more time spent to reduce the effects would have been in order.', '2004-09-11 17:57:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(904927, 102432, 8860, '<td valign="top">Not particulalrly appealing due to the intense underexposure, but it''s well composed.</td>', 'Not particulalrly appealing due to the intense underexposure, but it''s well composed.', '2004-09-11 17:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(904929, 102332, 8860, '<td valign="top">You''ve made the best of what could be a mundane subject and gloomy wetaher.! This is quite atmosphereic although I''m not sure it makes me want to visit - if that''s the intention.</td>', 'You''ve made the best of what could be a mundane subject and gloomy wetaher.! This is quite atmosphereic although I''m not sure it makes me want to visit - if that''s the intention.', '2004-09-11 17:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(904930, 102902, 8860, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but this is a bland scene shot from eye level with awkward exposure settings. It is actually well composed but you need to stop down a bit increase exposure time, use some fill lighting (or let the ambient light enter the censor) and maybe even use some muted flash. Also, try crouching down to bring in some detail and use a tripod if the light is poor.</td>', 'Sorry, but this is a bland scene shot from eye level with awkward exposure settings. It is actually well composed but you need to stop down a bit increase exposure time, use some fill lighting (or let the ambient light enter the censor) and maybe even use some muted flash. Also, try crouching down to bring in some detail and use a tripod if the light is poor.', '2004-09-11 18:01:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(904931, 103250, 8860, '<td valign="top">Good view that would appeal to me if I wanted a luxury hotel with golf nearby. Arguably just a snapshot but you chose the right angle for light to cast shadows and define detail.</td>', 'Good view that would appeal to me if I wanted a luxury hotel with golf nearby. Arguably just a snapshot but you chose the right angle for light to cast shadows and define detail.', '2004-09-11 18:03:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(904933, 103050, 8860, '<td valign="top">This really could be a multitude of places, but the viewpoint is good and it''s well composed.</td>', 'This really could be a multitude of places, but the viewpoint is good and it''s well composed.', '2004-09-11 18:04:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(904935, 102648, 8860, '<td valign="top">Not a bad view but the detail is lost due to uneven exposure.</td>', 'Not a bad view but the detail is lost due to uneven exposure.', '2004-09-11 18:07:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(904938, 102769, 8860, '<td valign="top">Lovely view which is definitely attractive to traveller. Perhaps too much sky and I''d like to see more river and greenery. A polariser might deepen the sky too.</td>', 'Lovely view which is definitely attractive to traveller. Perhaps too much sky and I''d like to see more river and greenery. A polariser might deepen the sky too.', '2004-09-11 18:11:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(904940, 102161, 8860, '<td valign="top">Nice clear shot. Colours are a bit dull but it''s well composed and I do love this city. My brother may be in that shot somewhere!...</td>', 'Nice clear shot. Colours are a bit dull but it''s well composed and I do love this city. My brother may be in that shot somewhere!...', '2004-09-11 18:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(904942, 102892, 8860, '<td valign="top">Unusual building shot appropriately - the jaunty angle adding to the character of architecture nicely. Dull weather didn''t help but you did well with what you had.</td>', 'Unusual building shot appropriately - the jaunty angle adding to the character of architecture nicely. Dull weather didn''t help but you did well with what you had.', '2004-09-11 18:14:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(904945, 103146, 8860, '<td valign="top">Lovely expanse of nature and sweeping focal range. A polariser may have added some richness and depth to the sky but it''s a good view.</td>', 'Lovely expanse of nature and sweeping focal range. A polariser may have added some richness and depth to the sky but it''s a good view.', '2004-09-11 18:16:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(904951, 103074, 8860, '<td valign="top">Wonderful choice of viewpoint and very dynamic subject - I''d love to walk down here. It strikes me that you may have focused a little too close though. I sense a bit of sharpness rescue towards the back of the focal range and you may have been better off focusing about 2/3 of the way into the distance which would have given you an almost infinite focal length (particulalry if were shooting at around f6-8). Border is a bit heavy, but I love it.</td>', 'Wonderful choice of viewpoint and very dynamic subject - I''d love to walk down here. It strikes me that you may have focused a little too close though. I sense a bit of sharpness rescue towards the back of the focal range and you may have been better off focusing about 2/3 of the way into the distance which would have given you an almost infinite focal length (particulalry if were shooting at around f6-8). Border is a bit heavy, but I love it.', '2004-09-11 18:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(904954, 102117, 8860, '<td valign="top">Nice approach and I can definitely see this in a guide. The extra interest of the birds really helps this and as such has lifted it from the ordinary to special status. Your treatment is almost excessive but not quite! I love this.</td>', 'Nice approach and I can definitely see this in a guide. The extra interest of the birds really helps this and as such has lifted it from the ordinary to special status. Your treatment is almost excessive but not quite! I love this.', '2004-09-11 18:22:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(904957, 103217, 8860, '<td valign="top">I''d have expected to have seen to many shots of the Canyon, but this is really nice - with the Colorado picked out nicely and plenty of detail. Well chosen portion to shoot - and that must have been a great trip.</td>', 'I''d have expected to have seen to many shots of the Canyon, but this is really nice - with the Colorado picked out nicely and plenty of detail. Well chosen portion to shoot - and that must have been a great trip.', '2004-09-11 18:23:15.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(904960, 102350, 8860, '<td valign="top">Lovely clear view at a nice time of day. The blue/green colour cast is actually very nice set off with the orange lighting. Nice job (and I love Yorkshire so I''m a bit biased I admit). <br/>: )</td>', 'Lovely clear view at a nice time of day. The blue/green colour cast is actually very nice set off with the orange lighting. Nice job (and I love Yorkshire so I''m a bit biased I admit). : )', '2004-09-11 18:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(904966, 102007, 8860, '<td valign="top">The sky here is openly overprocessed, so I won''t say that it looks obvious! There''s a touch of Six Feet Under about this with the solitary tree. Nicely observed - although as a travel guide image it loses points just a bit due to its lack of obvious attraction beyond an ordinary landscape - albeit made special in Photoshop.</td>', 'The sky here is openly overprocessed, so I won''t say that it looks obvious! There''s a touch of Six Feet Under about this with the solitary tree. Nicely observed - although as a travel guide image it loses points just a bit due to its lack of obvious attraction beyond an ordinary landscape - albeit made special in Photoshop.', '2004-09-11 18:29:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(904968, 102642, 8860, '<td valign="top">There''s an almost 3D rendered feel to this. Very unusual subject, very nicely dhot. I imagine this would appeal to many in a travel guide. Lighting is beautiful.</td>', 'There''s an almost 3D rendered feel to this. Very unusual subject, very nicely dhot. I imagine this would appeal to many in a travel guide. Lighting is beautiful.', '2004-09-11 18:31:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(904972, 102435, 8860, '<td valign="top">Your colours are a bit crazed here (and that''s not the only thing). : )<br/> <br/>Good composition and if you''re into weird outback killing renactments then this is the place to come I imagine!</td>', 'Your colours are a bit crazed here (and that''s not the only thing). : ) Good composition and if you''re into weird outback killing renactments then this is the place to come I imagine!', '2004-09-11 18:33:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(904974, 103048, 8860, '<td valign="top">This shot holds little appeal for me I''m afraid. The subjects have their backs turned on the viewer which immediately puts up a barrier. This coupled with the real barrier and limited view of the subject that the people seem interested in renders the scene quite pointless and bland. The colour in the distance is also quite ''dirty''. It is well composed (if a little skewed) but that off-screen action that seems to be more interesting than the scene we''re looking at is quite frustrating!  :)</td>', 'This shot holds little appeal for me I''m afraid. The subjects have their backs turned on the viewer which immediately puts up a barrier. This coupled with the real barrier and limited view of the subject that the people seem interested in renders the scene quite pointless and bland. The colour in the distance is also quite ''dirty''. It is well composed (if a little skewed) but that off-screen action that seems to be more interesting than the scene we''re looking at is quite frustrating!  :)', '2004-09-11 18:38:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(904977, 103239, 8860, '<td valign="top">I''m sure I''m not the first to mention the overprocessing that''s gone on here. Sadly it has all but destroyed your shot. I suspect however that there wasn''t much to destroy in the first instance though which may explain why you''ve done it. <br/> <br/>the colours are extremely washed out in the heavily blurred grass but oddly, the cows look OK. As for being featured in a travel guide I would doubt that this would sell the destination to many. Sorry.</td>', 'I''m sure I''m not the first to mention the overprocessing that''s gone on here. Sadly it has all but destroyed your shot. I suspect however that there wasn''t much to destroy in the first instance though which may explain why you''ve done it.  the colours are extremely washed out in the heavily blurred grass but oddly, the cows look OK. As for being featured in a travel guide I would doubt that this would sell the destination to many. Sorry.', '2004-09-11 18:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(904981, 103238, 8860, '<td valign="top">I love this shot - it''s tones, lighting and texture are just great. It''s not typical travel guide stuff which is why I find this so refreshing. I can imagine it featuring in a more select publication extolling the pros and cons of remote or unusual locations, perhaps something like a Rough Guide or even a Backpacker''s Bible, etc.<br/> <br/>One of my top picks - but I''m just slightly bugged that it''s skewed slightly clockwise.</td>', 'I love this shot - it''s tones, lighting and texture are just great. It''s not typical travel guide stuff which is why I find this so refreshing. I can imagine it featuring in a more select publication extolling the pros and cons of remote or unusual locations, perhaps something like a Rough Guide or even a Backpacker''s Bible, etc. One of my top picks - but I''m just slightly bugged that it''s skewed slightly clockwise.', '2004-09-11 18:45:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(904983, 102168, 8860, '<td valign="top">There''s some bizarre lighting going on in the sky here but I relly like the shot. Great focus and well exposed. It''s perhaps missing a key focal point as my tends to run out of the back of the shot. Well compsoed too and a lovely time of day.</td>', 'There''s some bizarre lighting going on in the sky here but I relly like the shot. Great focus and well exposed. It''s perhaps missing a key focal point as my tends to run out of the back of the shot. Well compsoed too and a lovely time of day.', '2004-09-11 18:47:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(904985, 102518, 8860, '<td valign="top">Great use of the slow shutter speed to achieve some very appealing effects in the sky and water. The sacrifice is the hot spots from the overesposed lights but it''s not too bad. Great comp and a lovely shot.</td>', 'Great use of the slow shutter speed to achieve some very appealing effects in the sky and water. The sacrifice is the hot spots from the overesposed lights but it''s not too bad. Great comp and a lovely shot.', '2004-09-11 18:49:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(904986, 102677, 8860, '<td valign="top">Great capture and an intriguing subject. The shadow over the sculpture is a bit annoying but it''s well composed.</td>', 'Great capture and an intriguing subject. The shadow over the sculpture is a bit annoying but it''s well composed.', '2004-09-11 18:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(904988, 102741, 8860, '<td valign="top">This shot''s interest is mainly thanks to the subject and not your choice of angle, etc. You could have crouched and got some more foreground in since the sky is quite bland but the river very interesting. Well composed otherwise and they are lovely windmills.</td>', 'This shot''s interest is mainly thanks to the subject and not your choice of angle, etc. You could have crouched and got some more foreground in since the sky is quite bland but the river very interesting. Well composed otherwise and they are lovely windmills.', '2004-09-11 18:55:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(904992, 103240, 8860, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene if a little devoid of features to attract travellers.</td>', 'Beautiful scene if a little devoid of features to attract travellers.', '2004-09-11 18:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(904997, 103065, 8860, '<td valign="top">Dramatic subject but there is some haloing from the shad/hilite filter. Good choice of black &amp; white.</td>', 'Dramatic subject but there is some haloing from the shad/hilite filter. Good choice of black & white.', '2004-09-11 19:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(905001, 103224, 8860, '<td valign="top">Great viewpoint and lovely lighting. Subject is detailed and well shot.</td>', 'Great viewpoint and lovely lighting. Subject is detailed and well shot.', '2004-09-11 19:08:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(905018, 101498, 26711, '<td valign="top">I like the composition very much. An enormous amount of space in this piccture.</td>', 'I like the composition very much. An enormous amount of space in this piccture.', '2004-09-11 19:27:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(905070, 103257, 25464, '<td valign="top">I like the out of the box approach.  I think the background is a bit distracting - busy, and the black and white seems a little gray, but overall nice photo.</td>', 'I like the out of the box approach.  I think the background is a bit distracting - busy, and the black and white seems a little gray, but overall nice photo.', '2004-09-11 20:00:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(905071, 102985, 25464, '<td valign="top">This looks like something out of a magazine.  Good job.</td>', 'This looks like something out of a magazine.  Good job.', '2004-09-11 20:01:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(905072, 102892, 25464, '<td valign="top">I like this approach and the color is lovely, but it is a bit too tilted in my opinion.  I may need dramamine :)  Good job though.</td>', 'I like this approach and the color is lovely, but it is a bit too tilted in my opinion.  I may need dramamine :)  Good job though.', '2004-09-11 20:03:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(905074, 102284, 25464, '<td valign="top">Much more interesting that a plain ole city scape.  Good composition.  The color is a bit washed out. Maybe could have been adjusted in PS.  Good.</td>', 'Much more interesting that a plain ole city scape.  Good composition.  The color is a bit washed out. Maybe could have been adjusted in PS.  Good.', '2004-09-11 20:05:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(905076, 102530, 14476, '<td valign="top">Beautifully exposed, good and sharp.  Maybe could have been even better if you could have found a spot where you could have eliminated the waiting crowd and the buildings.  Um, I apologize if that spot would have put you in the middle of the water.... :&gt;)</td>', 'Beautifully exposed, good and sharp.  Maybe could have been even better if you could have found a spot where you could have eliminated the waiting crowd and the buildings.  Um, I apologize if that spot would have put you in the middle of the water.... :>)', '2004-09-11 20:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(905078, 103146, 14476, '<td valign="top">Would have been good to see this on a sparkling clear day, too.  But we take what we can get and this is good!</td>', 'Would have been good to see this on a sparkling clear day, too.  But we take what we can get and this is good!', '2004-09-11 20:08:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(905079, 103072, 25464, '<td valign="top">If only you could have trimmed that tree back :)  Nice.</td>', 'If only you could have trimmed that tree back :)  Nice.', '2004-09-11 20:08:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(905082, 103163, 14476, '<td valign="top">This is so appealing that if many folks were inspired to visit, well, there goes the view!  Seriously, you picked a great time of day and it''s lovely.</td>', 'This is so appealing that if many folks were inspired to visit, well, there goes the view!  Seriously, you picked a great time of day and it''s lovely.', '2004-09-11 20:09:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(905083, 103148, 14476, '<td valign="top">Wish you could have waited a few more minutes to get a nice glow;  this is a little flat, but still a good composition.</td>', 'Wish you could have waited a few more minutes to get a nice glow;  this is a little flat, but still a good composition.', '2004-09-11 20:10:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(905085, 102952, 14476, '<td valign="top">Cities tend to look so clean at night.  Good composition and lovely colors  on this one.</td>', 'Cities tend to look so clean at night.  Good composition and lovely colors  on this one.', '2004-09-11 20:11:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(905086, 103245, 25464, '<td valign="top">This would have been great if the tree hadn''t been in the middle of the shot. I really like the action.</td>', 'This would have been great if the tree hadn''t been in the middle of the shot. I really like the action.', '2004-09-11 20:11:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(905088, 103141, 14476, '<td valign="top">You waited for the perfect time of day, and did a fine job with this one.  Really, terrific image.  10</td>', 'You waited for the perfect time of day, and did a fine job with this one.  Really, terrific image.  10', '2004-09-11 20:12:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(905090, 103263, 14476, '<td valign="top">We get these perfect coastside shots infrequently, and when they happens it sure does bring home the fact that we live in paradise.  Really good image.  10</td>', 'We get these perfect coastside shots infrequently, and when they happens it sure does bring home the fact that we live in paradise.  Really good image.  10', '2004-09-11 20:13:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(905094, 102161, 14476, '<td valign="top">Ahhh, someone went to TI with a tripod.  good shot.  (Do you also have one with the bay bridge on the left?)  Never mind, this will do nicely!  10</td>', 'Ahhh, someone went to TI with a tripod.  good shot.  (Do you also have one with the bay bridge on the left?)  Never mind, this will do nicely!  10', '2004-09-11 20:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(905095, 103012, 14476, '<td valign="top">These civic sculpures are terrific!  Glad you showed us this one.   Perhaps your photographer''s notes will tell us   "who dunnit."  Oh, yes:  Nicely photographed as well!</td>', 'These civic sculpures are terrific!  Glad you showed us this one.   Perhaps your photographer''s notes will tell us   "who dunnit."  Oh, yes:  Nicely photographed as well!', '2004-09-11 20:17:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(905099, 102123, 14476, '<td valign="top">This is a good crisp photo and a good story.  Wonder if compositionally, it would also work well if you had positioned your camera at one or the other edge of the railing creating a diagonal to that exciting structure in the back.  Not a critique, but a suggestion.  Image is a good one.</td>', 'This is a good crisp photo and a good story.  Wonder if compositionally, it would also work well if you had positioned your camera at one or the other edge of the railing creating a diagonal to that exciting structure in the back.  Not a critique, but a suggestion.  Image is a good one.', '2004-09-11 20:19:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(905101, 102258, 14476, '<td valign="top">Great use of color in the foreground!  Well composed and super sharp.  Nice one!</td>', 'Great use of color in the foreground!  Well composed and super sharp.  Nice one!', '2004-09-11 20:20:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(905104, 103050, 14476, '<td valign="top">Cute one!  Nice take on the Challenge.</td>', 'Cute one!  Nice take on the Challenge.', '2004-09-11 20:21:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(905108, 102936, 14476, '<td valign="top">Super image!  Two fixer-uppers in one shot.  :&gt;)</td>', 'Super image!  Two fixer-uppers in one shot.  :>)', '2004-09-11 20:23:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(905110, 102987, 14476, '<td valign="top">Great image, and the bird is perfect.  Great time of day.  Glad you waited.  10</td>', 'Great image, and the bird is perfect.  Great time of day.  Glad you waited.  10', '2004-09-11 20:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(905112, 102350, 14476, '<td valign="top">Oh, my.  You certainly did hit this at the right time of day, very, very early.   Looks like a fairyland in there!   I''d go there in an instant.  10</td>', 'Oh, my.  You certainly did hit this at the right time of day, very, very early.   Looks like a fairyland in there!   I''d go there in an instant.  10', '2004-09-11 20:28:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(905115, 103255, 14476, '<td valign="top">Sunset/sunrise are the perfect times of day for these shots and you nailed it.  Did you agonize over that patch of light in the low middle of the rocks?  Maybe a bit of cropping could have taken that tiny bit of distraction away.  The person above the light patch is a fine touch. 8</td>', 'Sunset/sunrise are the perfect times of day for these shots and you nailed it.  Did you agonize over that patch of light in the low middle of the rocks?  Maybe a bit of cropping could have taken that tiny bit of distraction away.  The person above the light patch is a fine touch. 8', '2004-09-11 20:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(905118, 102546, 14476, '<td valign="top">Grat subject.  Expect desaturation was a good idea because of the riot of colors that would compete for attention.  But for some reason, it seems a bit soft.  Still a fine entry for this Challenge.  6</td>', 'Grat subject.  Expect desaturation was a good idea because of the riot of colors that would compete for attention.  But for some reason, it seems a bit soft.  Still a fine entry for this Challenge.  6', '2004-09-11 20:36:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(905119, 103242, 22734, '<td valign="top">returning for comments<br/>This is simply stunning with these myriad of warm times, then the mountain, then the sky ! Bumping up.</td>', 'returning for commentsThis is simply stunning with these myriad of warm times, then the mountain, then the sky ! Bumping up.', '2004-09-11 20:36:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(905121, 103121, 14476, '<td valign="top">I always like it when the bird''s beak points one way and the arrow the other...  Good one!</td>', 'I always like it when the bird''s beak points one way and the arrow the other...  Good one!', '2004-09-11 20:38:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(905122, 103224, 22734, '<td valign="top">beautiful poster-like image. razor sharp and adoring colors. Bumping up.</td>', 'beautiful poster-like image. razor sharp and adoring colors. Bumping up.', '2004-09-11 20:38:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(905124, 102007, 14476, '<td valign="top">Ummm, did you let your editing program get away with you on this one?  Maybe a bit oversaturated and stuff...  Still, a good idea.</td>', 'Ummm, did you let your editing program get away with you on this one?  Maybe a bit oversaturated and stuff...  Still, a good idea.', '2004-09-11 20:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(905125, 103155, 10818, '<td valign="top">Looks like a fun place for a refreshing beverage.  Very nice perspective.</td>', 'Looks like a fun place for a refreshing beverage.  Very nice perspective.', '2004-09-11 20:39:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(905127, 102435, 18197, '<td valign="top">I am sure i am missing some cultural clue but if I saw this in a guidebook, I wouldn''t go. Photo''s okay though.</td>', 'I am sure i am missing some cultural clue but if I saw this in a guidebook, I wouldn''t go. Photo''s okay though.', '2004-09-11 20:40:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(905128, 103193, 18197, '<td valign="top">Intriquing photo but the halos seem over processed.</td>', 'Intriquing photo but the halos seem over processed.', '2004-09-11 20:40:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(905129, 103188, 14476, '<td valign="top">Isn''t that flyer having a blissful time.  Good capture.</td>', 'Isn''t that flyer having a blissful time.  Good capture.', '2004-09-11 20:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(905130, 101884, 22734, '<td valign="top">returning for comments<br/>This is a lovely image with great color and great clarity. bumping up.</td>', 'returning for commentsThis is a lovely image with great color and great clarity. bumping up.', '2004-09-11 20:41:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(905131, 102808, 18197, '<td valign="top">Nice sky but for a travel guide, I would think you''d want to focus on the attraction.</td>', 'Nice sky but for a travel guide, I would think you''d want to focus on the attraction.', '2004-09-11 20:41:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(905134, 102892, 18197, '<td valign="top">The angle is a major distraction from this fine fine picture otherwise.</td>', 'The angle is a major distraction from this fine fine picture otherwise.', '2004-09-11 20:42:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(905135, 103155, 22734, '<td valign="top">returning for comments<br/>Very nice image. makes me want to go there for some drinks. Bumping up.</td>', 'returning for commentsVery nice image. makes me want to go there for some drinks. Bumping up.', '2004-09-11 20:42:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(905136, 103064, 18197, '<td valign="top">Very nice, clearly focused, and well composed image. But what guidebook would I find it in?</td>', 'Very nice, clearly focused, and well composed image. But what guidebook would I find it in?', '2004-09-11 20:43:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(905139, 103207, 14476, '<td valign="top">This is a tough one to get and your try is a good one, although perhaps a bit overexposed.  That lake is so very blue in real life.</td>', 'This is a tough one to get and your try is a good one, although perhaps a bit overexposed.  That lake is so very blue in real life.', '2004-09-11 20:43:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(905140, 102447, 22734, '<td valign="top">returning for comments<br/>Great warmth and great colors. Bumping.</td>', 'returning for commentsGreat warmth and great colors. Bumping.', '2004-09-11 20:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(905141, 102295, 18197, '<td valign="top">Feels way over processed. I notice it has been validated, so I''m sure it''s legal but the feeling of being over processed is a distraction. Great as a poster. Not great as a photo.</td>', 'Feels way over processed. I notice it has been validated, so I''m sure it''s legal but the feeling of being over processed is a distraction. Great as a poster. Not great as a photo.', '2004-09-11 20:44:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(905145, 103065, 14476, '<td valign="top">I like the black and white treatment of this fine architectural structure, but the border is, perhaps, a touch heavy.</td>', 'I like the black and white treatment of this fine architectural structure, but the border is, perhaps, a touch heavy.', '2004-09-11 20:46:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(905146, 103231, 10818, '<td valign="top">A wonderful shot.  Great colors a a sense of adventure.  I would absolutly love to ride that tram.</td>', 'A wonderful shot.  Great colors a a sense of adventure.  I would absolutly love to ride that tram.', '2004-09-11 20:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(905147, 102435, 14476, '<td valign="top">Yeeps, where do you live.  I don''t wanna go there!  Seriously, cute photo and nicely composed.</td>', 'Yeeps, where do you live.  I don''t wanna go there!  Seriously, cute photo and nicely composed.', '2004-09-11 20:47:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(905148, 102322, 10818, '<td valign="top">Thats magnificent.  Beautiful church, well done photo.</td>', 'Thats magnificent.  Beautiful church, well done photo.', '2004-09-11 20:47:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(905150, 103160, 19982, '<td valign="top">The highlighting was probably done in PS, but I love it!  This picture really brings the subject into focus and lends emotion to the image.  Excellent use of b&amp;w and DOF.</td>', 'The highlighting was probably done in PS, but I love it!  This picture really brings the subject into focus and lends emotion to the image.  Excellent use of b&w and DOF.', '2004-09-11 20:48:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(905153, 102666, 14476, '<td valign="top">Oh, but does he bite?  Seriously, I"m a sucker for a good bird shot and this is a good bird shot.  Thanks for putting it in the Challenge.</td>', 'Oh, but does he bite?  Seriously, I"m a sucker for a good bird shot and this is a good bird shot.  Thanks for putting it in the Challenge.', '2004-09-11 20:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
