(905165, 102422, 14476, '<td valign="top">Daily?  Wow, hope they clean up the streets.  Okay, this is a great effort, but maybe (at least on my monitor) it''s a touch overexposed.  If you have capabilities of bracketing, it can help a lot.  Then, well, those cowboys under the half of a "stockya" sign could come out - along with the sign - and it could tighten up the storyline quite a bit.   If it was mine, I''d probably crop a bit tighter around the remaining cowboys.  But that''s personal preference.   Hey, if it happens daily, might try again, if you like the shot well enough...</td>', 'Daily?  Wow, hope they clean up the streets.  Okay, this is a great effort, but maybe (at least on my monitor) it''s a touch overexposed.  If you have capabilities of bracketing, it can help a lot.  Then, well, those cowboys under the half of a "stockya" sign could come out - along with the sign - and it could tighten up the storyline quite a bit.   If it was mine, I''d probably crop a bit tighter around the remaining cowboys.  But that''s personal preference.   Hey, if it happens daily, might try again, if you like the shot well enough...', '2004-09-11 21:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
