(905399, 103247, 7560, '<td valign="top">This explains much. Obviously Texans use roads as photographic props and not places to drive. ;) I like the cloudline, and the color is good. My major problem is the placement of the road. It ends up dividing the lower thrid of the image in half. It just bugs me. You have a great thrids thing going all the way through (top third blue, next is the cloud layer, then the road/grass) .</td>', 'This explains much. Obviously Texans use roads as photographic props and not places to drive. ;) I like the cloudline, and the color is good. My major problem is the placement of the road. It ends up dividing the lower thrid of the image in half. It just bugs me. You have a great thrids thing going all the way through (top third blue, next is the cloud layer, then the road/grass) .', '2004-09-12 01:26:52.000000', NULL, 1),
