(905487, 103112, 18667, '<td valign="top">The roof is cut off and the border distracts from the image.  Even after those things, this rates a strong 6.</td>', 'The roof is cut off and the border distracts from the image.  Even after those things, this rates a strong 6.', '2004-09-12 03:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(905514, 102812, 21241, '<td valign="top">wow! beautiful!</td>', 'wow! beautiful!', '2004-09-12 04:17:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(905522, 101801, 6771, '<td valign="top">Outstanding!  One of the top 2 in this challenge (excluding mine of course (C:).<br/>Great colors and leading lines</td>', 'Outstanding!  One of the top 2 in this challenge (excluding mine of course (C:).Great colors and leading lines', '2004-09-12 04:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(905523, 103255, 6771, '<td valign="top">Awesome!  Love the colors in this.  Great composition. One of my top 2!!</td>', 'Awesome!  Love the colors in this.  Great composition. One of my top 2!!', '2004-09-12 04:50:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(905525, 102093, 6771, '<td valign="top">Great lines and "descending" symmetry.  The silhouette of the bring on the sunrise/set colors.</td>', 'Great lines and "descending" symmetry.  The silhouette of the bring on the sunrise/set colors.', '2004-09-12 04:56:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(905526, 102416, 6771, '<td valign="top">Great silhouette and colors.  The feathery clouds bring your eyes attention down into the rest of the picture.  Awesome!</td>', 'Great silhouette and colors.  The feathery clouds bring your eyes attention down into the rest of the picture.  Awesome!', '2004-09-12 04:57:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(905532, 102295, 6771, '<td valign="top">I really do like the look of this photo...but, it has lost its photographic integrity, to me.  My eye is definitely drawn to the people and them trying to escape the rain.</td>', 'I really do like the look of this photo...but, it has lost its photographic integrity, to me.  My eye is definitely drawn to the people and them trying to escape the rain.', '2004-09-12 05:04:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(905536, 103193, 6771, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot.  It suffers from a whole lot of haloing.  It appears that there are selected areas and then blur applied to it.  The colors are darker around the boy, the rocks on the right and along the top of the horizon line.  Something to work with would be the Pen tool (makes Paths), this would make tighter selecitons and decrease these types of problems.</td>', 'This is a nice shot.  It suffers from a whole lot of haloing.  It appears that there are selected areas and then blur applied to it.  The colors are darker around the boy, the rocks on the right and along the top of the horizon line.  Something to work with would be the Pen tool (makes Paths), this would make tighter selecitons and decrease these types of problems.', '2004-09-12 05:08:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(905538, 103239, 6771, '<td valign="top">The lighting is good on this, but it is cropped a little too close.  Like to see a little more of the environment.  the selective areas that have been blurred detract from the picture, to me.  The areas are really noticeable along the faces and along the middle cows ventral area.</td>', 'The lighting is good on this, but it is cropped a little too close.  Like to see a little more of the environment.  the selective areas that have been blurred detract from the picture, to me.  The areas are really noticeable along the faces and along the middle cows ventral area.', '2004-09-12 05:30:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(905539, 102007, 6771, '<td valign="top">This is a very great shot.  I love the contrast of colors between the foreground and the blue sky.  Ever without the tree, it would be a great shot.  The only point that I would have against it is the horizon line.  It appears that it is lower on the right.  Not sure if it is, but there looks like a hill farther off that is close in color to the foreground and makes it look higher there.</td>', 'This is a very great shot.  I love the contrast of colors between the foreground and the blue sky.  Ever without the tree, it would be a great shot.  The only point that I would have against it is the horizon line.  It appears that it is lower on the right.  Not sure if it is, but there looks like a hill farther off that is close in color to the foreground and makes it look higher there.', '2004-09-12 05:33:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(905543, 103259, 6771, '<td valign="top">The pic is good in many respects.  My problem is that it doesn''t instill Travel Guide to me.  It is atlas and he is holding the world, yeah, which can be travel, but....<br/>There is some area that is really bright that detracts a little.  Not sure if possible, but with the camera angle a little different, would it have made the windows more symmetrical with the statue?</td>', 'The pic is good in many respects.  My problem is that it doesn''t instill Travel Guide to me.  It is atlas and he is holding the world, yeah, which can be travel, but....There is some area that is really bright that detracts a little.  Not sure if possible, but with the camera angle a little different, would it have made the windows more symmetrical with the statue?', '2004-09-12 05:43:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(905544, 103048, 6771, '<td valign="top">Very nice colors and does give a travel feel with the loose clothing and view.  This suffers from the horizon line.  It is very distracting to the eye.  Especially the steeple.</td>', 'Very nice colors and does give a travel feel with the loose clothing and view.  This suffers from the horizon line.  It is very distracting to the eye.  Especially the steeple.', '2004-09-12 05:47:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(905545, 103211, 6771, '<td valign="top">Nice area.  Is overexposed, the sky and on top of the birds.  The light is harsh also, so I am guessing that the sun was high in the sky at this time.</td>', 'Nice area.  Is overexposed, the sky and on top of the birds.  The light is harsh also, so I am guessing that the sun was high in the sky at this time.', '2004-09-12 05:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(905546, 102737, 6771, '<td valign="top">COlors and subject work.  I would like to see this in much sharper focus on the monkeys.  A little more DOF may have helped some more.</td>', 'COlors and subject work.  I would like to see this in much sharper focus on the monkeys.  A little more DOF may have helped some more.', '2004-09-12 05:51:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(905547, 103166, 6771, '<td valign="top">Not sure what happened, but the colors seem off.  lots of hue shift in the top left corner, on the mountain and in the water.</td>', 'Not sure what happened, but the colors seem off.  lots of hue shift in the top left corner, on the mountain and in the water.', '2004-09-12 05:52:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(905548, 103254, 6771, '<td valign="top">This is a great composition of the skyline and waterway.  The colors seem very toned down and muddy.  In camera, a stop more on shutter speed or larger aperture may have worked; or in PS a touch more increase in the white level, and midtones to help.</td>', 'This is a great composition of the skyline and waterway.  The colors seem very toned down and muddy.  In camera, a stop more on shutter speed or larger aperture may have worked; or in PS a touch more increase in the white level, and midtones to help.', '2004-09-12 05:54:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(905551, 102811, 6771, '<td valign="top">Nice setup and capture.  good focus on the hands.  Hard to tell the candle is lit (who cares) because of the great colors.  The flash is just a touch to bright for me..toned down just a touch...perfect.  Nice work</td>', 'Nice setup and capture.  good focus on the hands.  Hard to tell the candle is lit (who cares) because of the great colors.  The flash is just a touch to bright for me..toned down just a touch...perfect.  Nice work', '2004-09-12 05:59:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(905556, 102703, 8054, '<td valign="top">Focus is a bit blurry and there is a considerable amount of noise. Composition could use some work as this has a snapshot feel about it. Colors are my favorite part of this entry as they are very interesting.</td>', 'Focus is a bit blurry and there is a considerable amount of noise. Composition could use some work as this has a snapshot feel about it. Colors are my favorite part of this entry as they are very interesting.', '2004-09-12 06:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(905565, 103224, 16004, '<td valign="top">there is a lot that i admire about this image.  i love the geometric qualities of the composition, it''s very isometric in appearance which is quite different.  colours are pleasantly spread across the shot too, moving from blue to a sany cream with the central buildings comprising both.   and the building on the far left is gorgeous - i would be most tempted to get lots of shots of that one.  technically, i think this is a wonderful piece. emotionally though it doesn''t do all that much for me, but i''m not sure why.  it is a very strong, visually appealling shot, but with something missing. no idea what.  still - 8.</td>', 'there is a lot that i admire about this image.  i love the geometric qualities of the composition, it''s very isometric in appearance which is quite different.  colours are pleasantly spread across the shot too, moving from blue to a sany cream with the central buildings comprising both.   and the building on the far left is gorgeous - i would be most tempted to get lots of shots of that one.  technically, i think this is a wonderful piece. emotionally though it doesn''t do all that much for me, but i''m not sure why.  it is a very strong, visually appealling shot, but with something missing. no idea what.  still - 8.', '2004-09-12 06:57:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(905568, 102295, 8860, '<td valign="top">This is a very effective use of this treatment. I do think it''s fairly inappropriate for this challenge since travel guides don''t typically use this effect, but I have seen stuff like it in travel brochures. It is taking leave of photographic integrity somewhat, but if you''re going to use the effect then this is a very good way to implement it.<br/> <br/>You''ve probably got a very decent photo under the FX, so I''ll add my voice to the doubtless many comments asking to see the original. I love the women''s pose and the composition is superb. I bet this scores well despite the treatment as it is quite compelling.<br/> <br/>Actually, I''ve never voted an artificially treated shot so highly.</td>', 'This is a very effective use of this treatment. I do think it''s fairly inappropriate for this challenge since travel guides don''t typically use this effect, but I have seen stuff like it in travel brochures. It is taking leave of photographic integrity somewhat, but if you''re going to use the effect then this is a very good way to implement it. You''ve probably got a very decent photo under the FX, so I''ll add my voice to the doubtless many comments asking to see the original. I love the women''s pose and the composition is superb. I bet this scores well despite the treatment as it is quite compelling. Actually, I''ve never voted an artificially treated shot so highly.', '2004-09-12 07:18:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(905569, 102666, 8860, '<td valign="top">Nice stark, graphic composition. Cute subject too.</td>', 'Nice stark, graphic composition. Cute subject too.', '2004-09-12 07:19:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(905570, 102899, 8860, '<td valign="top">Pleasant scene although weather has made this quite flat. Looks like some shad/hilite filter has left some haloing and colour mismatch from top to bottom. Also appears to be some obvious cloning on the top right.</td>', 'Pleasant scene although weather has made this quite flat. Looks like some shad/hilite filter has left some haloing and colour mismatch from top to bottom. Also appears to be some obvious cloning on the top right.', '2004-09-12 07:22:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(905571, 101592, 8860, '<td valign="top">Not much guidance here then - "sort your own travel - dunno how to get there"!  : )<br/> <br/>Looks like a very unusual destination though and definitley unique in the challenge.</td>', 'Not much guidance here then - "sort your own travel - dunno how to get there"!  : ) Looks like a very unusual destination though and definitley unique in the challenge.', '2004-09-12 07:23:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(905573, 102007, 16595, '<td valign="top">Now that really catches the eye.Great shot</td>', 'Now that really catches the eye.Great shot', '2004-09-12 07:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(905592, 102973, 14614, '<td valign="top">If I didn''t already want to visit Belgium, this photo would inspire me.  One of my ribbon picks this challenge... not only a great travel photo.  I like  you''re leading lines into the windmill, the punchy sky and grass and red barn.  The tree framing the windmill adds the perfect accent.  BOL</td>', 'If I didn''t already want to visit Belgium, this photo would inspire me.  One of my ribbon picks this challenge... not only a great travel photo.  I like  you''re leading lines into the windmill, the punchy sky and grass and red barn.  The tree framing the windmill adds the perfect accent.  BOL', '2004-09-12 08:42:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(905594, 103141, 14614, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorites this challenge -- I like the graduated light and leading lines you''ve captured.  I think I would like more light on the Monument than in the sky.  It''s a bit understated given the title and the theme.  BOL</td>', 'This is one of my favorites this challenge -- I like the graduated light and leading lines you''ve captured.  I think I would like more light on the Monument than in the sky.  It''s a bit understated given the title and the theme.  BOL', '2004-09-12 08:45:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(905596, 102741, 14614, '<td valign="top">Uhg on the title :)  Wow on the photo!  Like your use of light and leading lines.  Can picture this in the travel guide and makes me want to visit Holland again.  BOL  One of my ribbon picks this challenge</td>', 'Uhg on the title :)  Wow on the photo!  Like your use of light and leading lines.  Can picture this in the travel guide and makes me want to visit Holland again.  BOL  One of my ribbon picks this challenge', '2004-09-12 08:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(905600, 101995, 14614, '<td valign="top">You''ve captured the light here!  The moon is great element giving interest to the left side and a balance to the mountain background.  THe light on the church spotlights it.  I think your title blends the elements together.  One of my ribbon picks this challenge BOL</td>', 'You''ve captured the light here!  The moon is great element giving interest to the left side and a balance to the mountain background.  THe light on the church spotlights it.  I think your title blends the elements together.  One of my ribbon picks this challenge BOL', '2004-09-12 08:49:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(905601, 102161, 14614, '<td valign="top">you''ve caught the sparkle of a city scape -- long format is just right.  one of my favorites this challenge</td>', 'you''ve caught the sparkle of a city scape -- long format is just right.  one of my favorites this challenge', '2004-09-12 08:50:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(905604, 103166, 14614, '<td valign="top">something interesting in the fore/mid/background --- dramatic scene -- good use of water to refect the mountains.  one of my favorites this challenge</td>', 'something interesting in the fore/mid/background --- dramatic scene -- good use of water to refect the mountains.  one of my favorites this challenge', '2004-09-12 08:51:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(905606, 103232, 14614, '<td valign="top">I struggled with where to score this shot -- in the end made it one of my favorites this challenge.  excelelnt "model" colors and clarity, the background gives me a sense of outdoors (which helps connect it to your title and to the theme)  BOL</td>', 'I struggled with where to score this shot -- in the end made it one of my favorites this challenge.  excelelnt "model" colors and clarity, the background gives me a sense of outdoors (which helps connect it to your title and to the theme)  BOL', '2004-09-12 08:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(905607, 102126, 14614, '<td valign="top">peaceful scene -- lovely muted colors and framed well.  could use a bit of leveling.  one of my favorites this challenge</td>', 'peaceful scene -- lovely muted colors and framed well.  could use a bit of leveling.  one of my favorites this challenge', '2004-09-12 08:54:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(905610, 103242, 14614, '<td valign="top">the light and colors are wonderful... composition sufferes a bit from the strainght on view... one of my favorites this challenge bol</td>', 'the light and colors are wonderful... composition sufferes a bit from the strainght on view... one of my favorites this challenge bol', '2004-09-12 08:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(905611, 103266, 14614, '<td valign="top">I guess I don''t get out much because I''m not sure what city this is :)<br/> <br/>Great use of light -- the sky adds a lovely touch to the composition... a bit too much water in the foreground as I feel some of the drama you''ve created with light gets disapated (?spelling) with the duller gray foreground.  One of my favorites this challenge.  bol</td>', 'I guess I don''t get out much because I''m not sure what city this is :) Great use of light -- the sky adds a lovely touch to the composition... a bit too much water in the foreground as I feel some of the drama you''ve created with light gets disapated (?spelling) with the duller gray foreground.  One of my favorites this challenge.  bol', '2004-09-12 08:57:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(905614, 102350, 14614, '<td valign="top">a magical feeling here!  the golds and blue/greens sparkle with the light (I''m not sure how you got this effect but I like it)  I think the border holds the shot back as it becomes an element not a frame (I''m usually a fan of borders but not this one, sorry)</td>', 'a magical feeling here!  the golds and blue/greens sparkle with the light (I''m not sure how you got this effect but I like it)  I think the border holds the shot back as it becomes an element not a frame (I''m usually a fan of borders but not this one, sorry)', '2004-09-12 09:00:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(905638, 103102, 25483, '<td valign="top">Is there some illegal editing going on hear? What is that unnatural glow doing around the statue?<br/> <br/>I like the picture but I cant help being a little suspicious. <br/> <br/>Ill give you the benefit of the doubt and  an 8<br/> <br/> <br/></td>', 'Is there some illegal editing going on hear? What is that unnatural glow doing around the statue? I like the picture but I cant help being a little suspicious.  Ill give you the benefit of the doubt and  an 8  ', '2004-09-12 10:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(905639, 102295, 25483, '<td valign="top">Yours is the scond picture</td>', 'Yours is the scond picture', '2004-09-12 10:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(905643, 102968, 7560, '<td valign="top">The more I look at this shot the more I like it. I like the choice of black and white. I love the element of one tortise peeking into the shell of the other.  For this particular challenge, it''s a strong shot- but doesn''t say travel guide. That in no way, shape or form makes it any less interesting. Solid DOD and good composition make this a very good image. I see this as something that can end up on a greeting card. :) 7 for this challenge, 9 just on merit. :)</td>', 'The more I look at this shot the more I like it. I like the choice of black and white. I love the element of one tortise peeking into the shell of the other.  For this particular challenge, it''s a strong shot- but doesn''t say travel guide. That in no way, shape or form makes it any less interesting. Solid DOD and good composition make this a very good image. I see this as something that can end up on a greeting card. :) 7 for this challenge, 9 just on merit. :)', '2004-09-12 10:40:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(905656, 103152, 7560, '<td valign="top">I''d love to see this race. :) Looks like there are some blown highlites in this. We are also too far away to see the energy of the event. If you are using a dSLR, then I''d suggest a better lens. If you are using a point and shoot, then get closer. :) In this type of event, part of the fun is the energy. That said, it does meed the travel guide feel. 6</td>', 'I''d love to see this race. :) Looks like there are some blown highlites in this. We are also too far away to see the energy of the event. If you are using a dSLR, then I''d suggest a better lens. If you are using a point and shoot, then get closer. :) In this type of event, part of the fun is the energy. That said, it does meed the travel guide feel. 6', '2004-09-12 11:01:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(905658, 102694, 23680, '<td valign="top">Great 10</td>', 'Great 10', '2004-09-12 11:02:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(905662, 102816, 7560, '<td valign="top">I''d love seeing this at sunrise/sunset. Statues don''t tend to look their best at midday. Good use of rule of thirds.</td>', 'I''d love seeing this at sunrise/sunset. Statues don''t tend to look their best at midday. Good use of rule of thirds.', '2004-09-12 11:04:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(905666, 102985, 7560, '<td valign="top">I love the energy in this shot and the angle you shot at. Great street shot!</td>', 'I love the energy in this shot and the angle you shot at. Great street shot!', '2004-09-12 11:07:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(905667, 102117, 7870, '<td valign="top">Nice sillhouette!  Lovely colours in the sky!</td>', 'Nice sillhouette!  Lovely colours in the sky!', '2004-09-12 11:07:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(905668, 102350, 7870, '<td valign="top">This is a fabulous shot with its beautifully mirrored reflections, the perfect balance between artificial and natural light, and the quiet evening mood enhanced by the slowly rising smoke from the single active chimney ... you obviously had the time to explore the village and find this spectacular vantage point (something I did not have when I visited the same village earlier this year).  I believe this will be an award-winning shot, if not the outright winner!</td>', 'This is a fabulous shot with its beautifully mirrored reflections, the perfect balance between artificial and natural light, and the quiet evening mood enhanced by the slowly rising smoke from the single active chimney ... you obviously had the time to explore the village and find this spectacular vantage point (something I did not have when I visited the same village earlier this year).  I believe this will be an award-winning shot, if not the outright winner!', '2004-09-12 11:08:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(905669, 103197, 8891, '<td valign="top">Where is this at in Saratoga? I only get up there once every two years or so to sing with the Orchestra at SPAC. We get herded from Albany, Troy, Schenectady or somewhere near to SPAC and get like 3-4 hours in Saratoga Springs. That''s about it...sure would like to see something different there...Centennial Park gets a little boring after awhile.<br/>Sorry....Very nice peaceful setting. Like the composition. Sure wish it was a bit bigger so I could enjoy more....thx and good luck.</td>', 'Where is this at in Saratoga? I only get up there once every two years or so to sing with the Orchestra at SPAC. We get herded from Albany, Troy, Schenectady or somewhere near to SPAC and get like 3-4 hours in Saratoga Springs. That''s about it...sure would like to see something different there...Centennial Park gets a little boring after awhile.Sorry....Very nice peaceful setting. Like the composition. Sure wish it was a bit bigger so I could enjoy more....thx and good luck.', '2004-09-12 11:09:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(905670, 103165, 7870, '<td valign="top">A great shot, which could have been improved by more light on the dark rock and therefore mor colour on the vegetation neat the waterfall.</td>', 'A great shot, which could have been improved by more light on the dark rock and therefore mor colour on the vegetation neat the waterfall.', '2004-09-12 11:10:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(905671, 103003, 7560, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed and nice lighting. I like the square crop and actually like the border on the image as well. :)</td>', 'Nicely composed and nice lighting. I like the square crop and actually like the border on the image as well. :)', '2004-09-12 11:10:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(905672, 103074, 7870, '<td valign="top">Clear, effective and attractive.</td>', 'Clear, effective and attractive.', '2004-09-12 11:11:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(905674, 103220, 7870, '<td valign="top">Fabulous moody shot ... love the colours in the sky!  Lake Michigan?</td>', 'Fabulous moody shot ... love the colours in the sky!  Lake Michigan?', '2004-09-12 11:12:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(905675, 103074, 8891, '<td valign="top">Wow....great composition...an alternative might have been to shoot lower and up and make the angle of the path even more severe....but I like this very much. Nice soothing scene and colors....maybe more reflections and blue in the sky? Really fine image as is.  Good Luck.</td>', 'Wow....great composition...an alternative might have been to shoot lower and up and make the angle of the path even more severe....but I like this very much. Nice soothing scene and colors....maybe more reflections and blue in the sky? Really fine image as is.  Good Luck.', '2004-09-12 11:12:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(905676, 103067, 7870, '<td valign="top">May have looked a lot nicer early evening while there was still light in the sky to sillhouette the building and reflect some blue in the water.</td>', 'May have looked a lot nicer early evening while there was still light in the sky to sillhouette the building and reflect some blue in the water.', '2004-09-12 11:13:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(905679, 103266, 7560, '<td valign="top">beautiful light. The sailboat really adds to the image. The sad thing is I still have no clue what city I''m in. :)  8</td>', 'beautiful light. The sailboat really adds to the image. The sad thing is I still have no clue what city I''m in. :)  8', '2004-09-12 11:13:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(905680, 102285, 7870, '<td valign="top">Another photo that would have looked much nicer earlier in the evening with some blue in the sky and blue reflected in the water.</td>', 'Another photo that would have looked much nicer earlier in the evening with some blue in the sky and blue reflected in the water.', '2004-09-12 11:14:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(905683, 102904, 7560, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot! I love the feel of the stone in the image. The thing that makes this one so nice is the point of view. How often do any of us look up? Well cropped and though out! 10</td>', 'Excellent shot! I love the feel of the stone in the image. The thing that makes this one so nice is the point of view. How often do any of us look up? Well cropped and though out! 10', '2004-09-12 11:15:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(905684, 103064, 20889, '<td valign="top">Don''t leave home without it :-)</td>', 'Don''t leave home without it :-)', '2004-09-12 11:15:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(905688, 101995, 7870, '<td valign="top">A very nice photo which would have been a little nice with more light on the vegetation</td>', 'A very nice photo which would have been a little nice with more light on the vegetation', '2004-09-12 11:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(905689, 102295, 7870, '<td valign="top">Hmmm ... not sure how to rate this photo, but it had immediate impact.  I will be interested in how you obtained these effects within the rules!</td>', 'Hmmm ... not sure how to rate this photo, but it had immediate impact.  I will be interested in how you obtained these effects within the rules!', '2004-09-12 11:17:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(905693, 102427, 7870, '<td valign="top">A nice photo ... but it is another in this challenge that would have been improved if it had been taken earlier in the evening with a little more light and a little more blue reflected in the water.  Canberra Australia?</td>', 'A nice photo ... but it is another in this challenge that would have been improved if it had been taken earlier in the evening with a little more light and a little more blue reflected in the water.  Canberra Australia?', '2004-09-12 11:22:43.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(905697, 103240, 7870, '<td valign="top">I love the lighting in the sky and water here - well done!</td>', 'I love the lighting in the sky and water here - well done!', '2004-09-12 11:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(905701, 103236, 20889, '<td valign="top">Bet this is pretty in the fall.</td>', 'Bet this is pretty in the fall.', '2004-09-12 11:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(905704, 103065, 20889, '<td valign="top">Looks very old also.</td>', 'Looks very old also.', '2004-09-12 11:25:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(905706, 102774, 7870, '<td valign="top">A fabulous building, beautiful colours in the sky, and taken at the right time of evening (I presume) - but the rail in the foreground right detracts from the photo.  A slightly tighter composition from a different angle with less foreground would have been a great shot.</td>', 'A fabulous building, beautiful colours in the sky, and taken at the right time of evening (I presume) - but the rail in the foreground right detracts from the photo.  A slightly tighter composition from a different angle with less foreground would have been a great shot.', '2004-09-12 11:27:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(905711, 102518, 7870, '<td valign="top">Amazing cloud formations and lighting!  I will be interested in knowing how you took this shot. I think the dark sky works for this photo when normally I would have preferred earlier in the evening with light in both the sky and reflections on the water.</td>', 'Amazing cloud formations and lighting!  I will be interested in knowing how you took this shot. I think the dark sky works for this photo when normally I would have preferred earlier in the evening with light in both the sky and reflections on the water.', '2004-09-12 11:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(905713, 102350, 7560, '<td valign="top">Beautiful reflections. I love the multiple light sources. York is on my list of UK cities to visit, and this image re-enforces that. 8</td>', 'Beautiful reflections. I love the multiple light sources. York is on my list of UK cities to visit, and this image re-enforces that. 8', '2004-09-12 11:29:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(905714, 102666, 7870, '<td valign="top">Fabulous colours in a great shot - but it would have been perfected by a little more light to outline the shape of the bird''s head</td>', 'Fabulous colours in a great shot - but it would have been perfected by a little more light to outline the shape of the bird''s head', '2004-09-12 11:31:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(905716, 101592, 7870, '<td valign="top">Wow - you must have a great lens (or telecsope!).</td>', 'Wow - you must have a great lens (or telecsope!).', '2004-09-12 11:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(905717, 103086, 20889, '<td valign="top">Like the setting.</td>', 'Like the setting.', '2004-09-12 11:33:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(905723, 103232, 7870, '<td valign="top">Nice photo spoiled a little by the cropping or framing ... cutting off the neck through the red feature and too much background on the right</td>', 'Nice photo spoiled a little by the cropping or framing ... cutting off the neck through the red feature and too much background on the right', '2004-09-12 11:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(905726, 101772, 7870, '<td valign="top">A familiar shot, but a nice mood set by the way in which you have treated the photo</td>', 'A familiar shot, but a nice mood set by the way in which you have treated the photo', '2004-09-12 11:37:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(905738, 101801, 6097, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture.  Looks like a storm is coming.  I really like how the sail  is set in the darker part of the photo making it stand out against the dark clouds.  I like the color tome of this photo and that there is a strongly defined horizon.  Good luck with the challenge!!!</td>', 'Very nice capture.  Looks like a storm is coming.  I really like how the sail  is set in the darker part of the photo making it stand out against the dark clouds.  I like the color tome of this photo and that there is a strongly defined horizon.  Good luck with the challenge!!!', '2004-09-12 11:46:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(905739, 103063, 6097, '<td valign="top">I really like the shadow play in this shot.  Very nice how it uses a natural gradient fade from black.  Very enchanting I think.  I could definatly see this in a travel guide for a City or State.  Good luck with the challenge!!!</td>', 'I really like the shadow play in this shot.  Very nice how it uses a natural gradient fade from black.  Very enchanting I think.  I could definatly see this in a travel guide for a City or State.  Good luck with the challenge!!!', '2004-09-12 11:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(905749, 103063, 8891, '<td valign="top">Nice night shot of this wonderful architecture.  This is different from the the Hallgrimur Church shot and yet I note some similarities in the design, both of which I like very much.  Compositon on this is very fine, but I wish the front tower we not chopped off . Like the color and the lines. Good luck.</td>', 'Nice night shot of this wonderful architecture.  This is different from the the Hallgrimur Church shot and yet I note some similarities in the design, both of which I like very much.  Compositon on this is very fine, but I wish the front tower we not chopped off . Like the color and the lines. Good luck.', '2004-09-12 11:52:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(905752, 103122, 6097, '<td valign="top">Love the black and white!  I really like how you have all tones in this image from very bright white to completely black.  That''s what a true black and white photo is.  This is almost a complete silhouette image which I really like.  Just enough detail in the water to keep your interest along with the very nice silhouette look.  Love that you used the rule of thirds for the boat and put the horizon just about in the middle.  I''m sure you will also have some that don''t like the frame but I like it very much.  I probably wouldn''t like the frame on a color version of this but I think it really adds to this B&amp;W version.</td>', 'Love the black and white!  I really like how you have all tones in this image from very bright white to completely black.  That''s what a true black and white photo is.  This is almost a complete silhouette image which I really like.  Just enough detail in the water to keep your interest along with the very nice silhouette look.  Love that you used the rule of thirds for the boat and put the horizon just about in the middle.  I''m sure you will also have some that don''t like the frame but I like it very much.  I probably wouldn''t like the frame on a color version of this but I think it really adds to this B&W version.', '2004-09-12 11:52:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(905755, 102694, 20889, '<td valign="top">A small step into the past.</td>', 'A small step into the past.', '2004-09-12 11:56:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(905769, 102677, 8891, '<td valign="top">Amazing...tell me when this one appears in a travel guide...it certainly should. Lovely composition and GREAT rainbow. Good luck</td>', 'Amazing...tell me when this one appears in a travel guide...it certainly should. Lovely composition and GREAT rainbow. Good luck', '2004-09-12 12:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(905772, 103250, 8891, '<td valign="top">It appears that this needs a slight CW rotation. I thiink you went up a little to far on the hill for this and maybe lower might have been better in order to show more of the resort and less of the little bit of the surrounding town. The golf course area or lower two thirds of this is very nice.</td>', 'It appears that this needs a slight CW rotation. I thiink you went up a little to far on the hill for this and maybe lower might have been better in order to show more of the resort and less of the little bit of the surrounding town. The golf course area or lower two thirds of this is very nice.', '2004-09-12 12:14:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(905775, 102892, 8891, '<td valign="top">the angle leaves me cold. The architecture is very nice, and the colors and exposure of the building are very good. Using the same angle, you might crop down and in left a bit a knock our the sky which is washed out.</td>', 'the angle leaves me cold. The architecture is very nice, and the colors and exposure of the building are very good. Using the same angle, you might crop down and in left a bit a knock our the sky which is washed out.', '2004-09-12 12:18:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(905780, 102738, 8891, '<td valign="top">The colors look a bit unreal in this. They are not altogether unpleasant. Perhaps too surreal for a travel guide. Nice compostion.</td>', 'The colors look a bit unreal in this. They are not altogether unpleasant. Perhaps too surreal for a travel guide. Nice compostion.', '2004-09-12 12:20:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(905789, 102350, 16800, '<td valign="top">I never had an urge to visit the UK, till I saw your photo.  Marvelous!!<br/></td>', 'I never had an urge to visit the UK, till I saw your photo.  Marvelous!!', '2004-09-12 12:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(905790, 101801, 7969, '<td valign="top">great shot, really nice light</td>', 'great shot, really nice light', '2004-09-12 12:27:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(905809, 102973, 14603, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed using the old fence and branches to lead to, and frame, your subject.<br/>Good work</td>', 'Nicely composed using the old fence and branches to lead to, and frame, your subject.Good work', '2004-09-12 12:58:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(905810, 103084, 14603, '<td valign="top">Very imposing structure..well captured</td>', 'Very imposing structure..well captured', '2004-09-12 12:59:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(905813, 103218, 14603, '<td valign="top">You did well to avoid using a conventional but boring viewpoint.<br/>I like the way you`ve split your image diagonally...nice work</td>', 'You did well to avoid using a conventional but boring viewpoint.I like the way you`ve split your image diagonally...nice work', '2004-09-12 13:02:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(905814, 103255, 16636, '<td valign="top">This is really cool, personally I would have taken the figure out of the image, like this a lot - 10</td>', 'This is really cool, personally I would have taken the figure out of the image, like this a lot - 10', '2004-09-12 13:06:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(905817, 103263, 16636, '<td valign="top">excellent image, good luck</td>', 'excellent image, good luck', '2004-09-12 13:07:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(905823, 103224, 14603, '<td valign="top">I like the way you have divided the image up into thirds.<br/>Also the use of differing shapes in those thirds helps to keep the image interesting.  Nicely done.</td>', 'I like the way you have divided the image up into thirds.Also the use of differing shapes in those thirds helps to keep the image interesting.  Nicely done.', '2004-09-12 13:17:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(905834, 101801, 14603, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image taken in the type of conditions that I have been hoping to encounter for quite some time (Bright sunlight against an inky black sky).<br/>You have certainly made the most of this opportunity.<br/>Very well done.</td>', 'Beautiful image taken in the type of conditions that I have been hoping to encounter for quite some time (Bright sunlight against an inky black sky).You have certainly made the most of this opportunity.Very well done.', '2004-09-12 13:30:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(905840, 103054, 14603, '<td valign="top">Nice bit of humour in the title, to go with a nicely composed shot.<br/></td>', 'Nice bit of humour in the title, to go with a nicely composed shot.', '2004-09-12 13:38:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(905843, 103074, 14603, '<td valign="top">You`ve used an "Artist`s eye" for this one !<br/>Someone or something in either the immediate foreground or in the top third of this image would have made it perfect for me.<br/>Very well done</td>', 'You`ve used an "Artist`s eye" for this one !Someone or something in either the immediate foreground or in the top third of this image would have made it perfect for me.Very well done', '2004-09-12 13:45:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(905846, 103245, 10818, '<td valign="top">Great trials shot.  Not sure to many poeple will understand it, but I do  :)</td>', 'Great trials shot.  Not sure to many poeple will understand it, but I do  :)', '2004-09-12 13:50:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(905848, 102666, 7560, '<td valign="top">I love the way the blacks blend together and you just have the beak and the white on the bird''s neck.  Excellent lighting, and a great animal shot. Where''s the Fruit Loops? :) 9</td>', 'I love the way the blacks blend together and you just have the beak and the white on the bird''s neck.  Excellent lighting, and a great animal shot. Where''s the Fruit Loops? :) 9', '2004-09-12 13:55:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(905940, 103224, 18485, '<td valign="top">this is fantastic.  meets challenge and is beautifully cratted and well executed.  congrats.</td>', 'this is fantastic.  meets challenge and is beautifully cratted and well executed.  congrats.', '2004-09-12 15:42:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(905943, 103012, 18485, '<td valign="top">great shot!</td>', 'great shot!', '2004-09-12 15:44:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(905944, 101772, 18485, '<td valign="top">lvoely shot, and although i love the texture, it''s too grainy to meet "travel guide" challenge.</td>', 'lvoely shot, and although i love the texture, it''s too grainy to meet "travel guide" challenge.', '2004-09-12 15:45:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(905950, 102295, 18485, '<td valign="top">cool treatment, love the digitization of it.  not great as a "travel guide" shot but lovely and provocative nonetheless...</td>', 'cool treatment, love the digitization of it.  not great as a "travel guide" shot but lovely and provocative nonetheless...', '2004-09-12 15:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(905984, 101995, 8860, '<td valign="top">Nice subject and well composed but the image looks over treated with the shadow/hilight filter - giving rise to the familar halo. It''s a shame because it looks like an interesting place. Perhaps you were just too late for the sun.</td>', 'Nice subject and well composed but the image looks over treated with the shadow/hilight filter - giving rise to the familar halo. It''s a shame because it looks like an interesting place. Perhaps you were just too late for the sun.', '2004-09-12 16:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(906010, 103238, 245, '<td valign="top">It''s tilted! I want to see this rotated and reframed, to correct the tilt. :)</td>', 'It''s tilted! I want to see this rotated and reframed, to correct the tilt. :)', '2004-09-12 16:57:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(906024, 102729, 26725, '<td valign="top">nice cabbin nice country look</td>', 'nice cabbin nice country look', '2004-09-12 17:15:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(906043, 103141, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very nice. It would also be fun to see a shot where the reflection takes most of the frame. 9</td>', 'Very nice. It would also be fun to see a shot where the reflection takes most of the frame. 9', '2004-09-12 17:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(906047, 101801, 6870, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors and tones here. I''d put it in a travel catalogue! 9</td>', 'Lovely colors and tones here. I''d put it in a travel catalogue! 9', '2004-09-12 17:29:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(906048, 102007, 6870, '<td valign="top">Putting the tree centered was a brave move, but it works. The gradual darkening of the image toward the edges works well, too. 10</td>', 'Putting the tree centered was a brave move, but it works. The gradual darkening of the image toward the edges works well, too. 10', '2004-09-12 17:30:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(906050, 102364, 6870, '<td valign="top">I used to live in Pig''s Eye! It''s good to see the place again, and in such a lovely way! 9</td>', 'I used to live in Pig''s Eye! It''s good to see the place again, and in such a lovely way! 9', '2004-09-12 17:31:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(906051, 103236, 6870, '<td valign="top">Pleasant, clear shot. It may be fun to have the reflection as the showcase to be daring. Nice work. 8</td>', 'Pleasant, clear shot. It may be fun to have the reflection as the showcase to be daring. Nice work. 8', '2004-09-12 17:32:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(906077, 102518, 4517, '<td valign="top">Wow this is exceptional. Should be a blue ribbon. A little bit of noise/artifacts in the sky which neat image would clean up.</td>', 'Wow this is exceptional. Should be a blue ribbon. A little bit of noise/artifacts in the sky which neat image would clean up.', '2004-09-12 17:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(906083, 103003, 20889, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, not to big on your border. Is that cottonwood floating in the water, I hate that stuff when I''m fishing.</td>', 'Nice picture, not to big on your border. Is that cottonwood floating in the water, I hate that stuff when I''m fishing.', '2004-09-12 18:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(906084, 102653, 20889, '<td valign="top">Must be lunch time lol.</td>', 'Must be lunch time lol.', '2004-09-12 18:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(906085, 103042, 20889, '<td valign="top">Somebodies alway got to be different.</td>', 'Somebodies alway got to be different.', '2004-09-12 18:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(906093, 102999, 20889, '<td valign="top">Who needs garbageman, just sit it outside lol</td>', 'Who needs garbageman, just sit it outside lol', '2004-09-12 18:16:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(906112, 102126, 20889, '<td valign="top">Nice sky, but would that reflect that in the water? I would have increased blues and decreased reds and would have been much better imo</td>', 'Nice sky, but would that reflect that in the water? I would have increased blues and decreased reds and would have been much better imo', '2004-09-12 18:26:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(906114, 102117, 20889, '<td valign="top">And make sure your wearing a hat lol</td>', 'And make sure your wearing a hat lol', '2004-09-12 18:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(906120, 102811, 11977, '<td valign="top">Neat idea, well executed except I wish the horizon was straight.</td>', 'Neat idea, well executed except I wish the horizon was straight.', '2004-09-12 18:35:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(906170, 102985, 10390, '<td valign="top">Great travel guide pic, I like it, top 10 imo</td>', 'Great travel guide pic, I like it, top 10 imo', '2004-09-12 19:27:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(906173, 102007, 10390, '<td valign="top">Outstanding image, I like it a lot. If there would be something to change, it would maybe be the position of the tree, maybe not a central position??? I''m not sure. I''d guess this will end up high, maybe it will get a ribbon.<br/></td>', 'Outstanding image, I like it a lot. If there would be something to change, it would maybe be the position of the tree, maybe not a central position??? I''m not sure. I''d guess this will end up high, maybe it will get a ribbon.', '2004-09-12 19:37:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(906182, 103226, 14603, '<td valign="top">Love the composition and clarity of this shot.. it gives a real taste of the "deep south" and certainly what I would expect to see in any guide book for the area.<br/>Very nicely done.<br/>Bumping from 7 to 8</td>', 'Love the composition and clarity of this shot.. it gives a real taste of the "deep south" and certainly what I would expect to see in any guide book for the area.Very nicely done.Bumping from 7 to 8', '2004-09-12 19:42:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(906190, 103238, 11738, '<td valign="top">It could be an artifcat of distortion, but the stairs sem to tilt to the right.  Ok image, but does not fit challenge requirements as it is described.  So much for "out of the box".  I like the image though and really like how the top stairs fade into the light.  I would have cloned out that grate over the topiary.</td>', 'It could be an artifcat of distortion, but the stairs sem to tilt to the right.  Ok image, but does not fit challenge requirements as it is described.  So much for "out of the box".  I like the image though and really like how the top stairs fade into the light.  I would have cloned out that grate over the topiary.', '2004-09-12 19:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(906195, 103051, 11738, '<td valign="top">I think you named your shot after the poses of your two subjects, but I really think that they take away from the shot as we see them here.  Subjects walking away or sitting on the dock with feet in water might have been better.  Love the blues and aquas of this shot.</td>', 'I think you named your shot after the poses of your two subjects, but I really think that they take away from the shot as we see them here.  Subjects walking away or sitting on the dock with feet in water might have been better.  Love the blues and aquas of this shot.', '2004-09-12 19:54:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(906196, 102508, 6999, '<td valign="top">I find the light a touch harsh here - seems very high contrast, very stark. But it''s a suitable scene, certainly. Iwas going to say i thought there was too much sky, but I guess I can see the point of that movement to deep blue.</td>', 'I find the light a touch harsh here - seems very high contrast, very stark. But it''s a suitable scene, certainly. Iwas going to say i thought there was too much sky, but I guess I can see the point of that movement to deep blue.', '2004-09-12 19:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(906198, 102774, 11738, '<td valign="top">Nice concept with the stone guradrail, but it feels too heavy, it anchors the shot too strongly in the lower right corner.  I know this may have ben impossible, but taing the shot from higher up could have eliminated this.  Not an easy task unless you carry with you a step ladder :)</td>', 'Nice concept with the stone guradrail, but it feels too heavy, it anchors the shot too strongly in the lower right corner.  I know this may have ben impossible, but taing the shot from higher up could have eliminated this.  Not an easy task unless you carry with you a step ladder :)', '2004-09-12 19:56:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(906199, 102741, 11738, '<td valign="top">Interesting image, but colours seem oversaturated.  A compression artifact from reducing the image maybe?  My submission has the same problem.  It looks great in its original size, but suffers from degrdation from resizing.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-09-13 22:33:15.</i></td>', 'Interesting image, but colours seem oversaturated.  A compression artifact from reducing the image maybe?  My submission has the same problem.  It looks great in its original size, but suffers from degrdation from resizing.', '2004-09-12 19:58:30.000000', '2004-09-13 23:33:15.000000', 1),
(906201, 102126, 6999, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully serene light - I just really really wish, especially forr this challenge, that you''d done something about the noise in this shot. it just doesn''t match the kind of shot it is, nor the scene, nor the mood of it. cleaned up, it would be spectacular. 6</td>', 'Wonderfully serene light - I just really really wish, especially forr this challenge, that you''d done something about the noise in this shot. it just doesn''t match the kind of shot it is, nor the scene, nor the mood of it. cleaned up, it would be spectacular. 6', '2004-09-12 20:02:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(906217, 103254, 11738, '<td valign="top">This image is suffering from a green/yellow cast.</td>', 'This image is suffering from a green/yellow cast.', '2004-09-12 20:29:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(906227, 101592, 15920, '<td valign="top">Great shot of the moom, with pretty amazing detail relative to what I usually get from my lenses.  But, I am having a bit of trouble thinking of this as a travel guide, and science project, even with the support of your title.</td>', 'Great shot of the moom, with pretty amazing detail relative to what I usually get from my lenses.  But, I am having a bit of trouble thinking of this as a travel guide, and science project, even with the support of your title.', '2004-09-12 20:43:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(906228, 103050, 15920, '<td valign="top">Nice detail on the feathers.  It might have been better with a little fill flash, as it looks like you nailed the expression on the seagull perfectly.</td>', 'Nice detail on the feathers.  It might have been better with a little fill flash, as it looks like you nailed the expression on the seagull perfectly.', '2004-09-12 20:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(906229, 102258, 15920, '<td valign="top">THe colors here are excellent.  Good eye.</td>', 'THe colors here are excellent.  Good eye.', '2004-09-12 20:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(906236, 102435, 15920, '<td valign="top">I saw this idea in a movie, which name escapes me, but it was one of you Aussies that took on the government and became famous.  The POV and cloudy sky really make this shot.</td>', 'I saw this idea in a movie, which name escapes me, but it was one of you Aussies that took on the government and became famous.  The POV and cloudy sky really make this shot.', '2004-09-12 20:51:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(906239, 102676, 15920, '<td valign="top">Perfect colors.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Perfect colors.  Nicely done.', '2004-09-12 20:52:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(906240, 102737, 15920, '<td valign="top">This is great composition, but the focus on the face needs to be just a little sharper.</td>', 'This is great composition, but the focus on the face needs to be just a little sharper.', '2004-09-12 20:53:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(906243, 102892, 15920, '<td valign="top">Love the colors, lighting, and clarity.  The extreme crop doesn''t really enhance this shot though.</td>', 'Love the colors, lighting, and clarity.  The extreme crop doesn''t really enhance this shot though.', '2004-09-12 20:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(906270, 102322, 26361, '<td valign="top">What a peaceful, beautiful church.  Nice shot.</td>', 'What a peaceful, beautiful church.  Nice shot.', '2004-09-12 21:19:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(906277, 102981, 6661, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, great contrast, lovely saturation.. what more can I say!</td>', 'Nice composition, great contrast, lovely saturation.. what more can I say!', '2004-09-12 21:25:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(906278, 101801, 5286, '<td valign="top">Stunning. I hope you ribbon. I really do.</td>', 'Stunning. I hope you ribbon. I really do.', '2004-09-12 21:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(906280, 101797, 8054, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo and perspective. Clouds seem a little overexposed.</td>', 'Interesting photo and perspective. Clouds seem a little overexposed.', '2004-09-12 21:29:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(906281, 102737, 8054, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and perspective. Exposure seems a little dark.</td>', 'Nice composition and perspective. Exposure seems a little dark.', '2004-09-12 21:29:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(906286, 101611, 8054, '<td valign="top">Excellent exposure and composition. Love the deep blue of the sky. Downside: not sure what this wooden box on a pole has to do with BC.</td>', 'Excellent exposure and composition. Love the deep blue of the sky. Downside: not sure what this wooden box on a pole has to do with BC.', '2004-09-12 21:31:46.000000', NULL, 1),
