(906458, 102676, 10275, '<td valign="top">Bautifully lit. Great colour contrast.</td>', 'Bautifully lit. Great colour contrast.', '2004-09-12 23:25:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(906459, 102427, 10275, '<td valign="top">Lovely night shot. Great colour.</td>', 'Lovely night shot. Great colour.', '2004-09-12 23:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(906460, 103263, 10275, '<td valign="top">This photo evokes a peaceful emotion in me. It makes me want to walk right into it. Well done.</td>', 'This photo evokes a peaceful emotion in me. It makes me want to walk right into it. Well done.', '2004-09-12 23:26:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(906466, 103212, 19322, '<td valign="top">Somehow lacks a sense of space.</td>', 'Somehow lacks a sense of space.', '2004-09-12 23:33:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(906473, 102738, 19322, '<td valign="top">I don''t care for the color or the overly slow shutter effect on the falls.</td>', 'I don''t care for the color or the overly slow shutter effect on the falls.', '2004-09-12 23:36:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(906478, 101704, 22734, '<td valign="top">Returning for comments.<br/>A convincing action shot of a great scary moment.</td>', 'Returning for comments.A convincing action shot of a great scary moment.', '2004-09-12 23:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(906479, 102124, 22734, '<td valign="top">Returning for comments.<br/>Subdued beauty with a subdued silhoette and the foreground  foliage adding more magic.</td>', 'Returning for comments.Subdued beauty with a subdued silhoette and the foreground  foliage adding more magic.', '2004-09-12 23:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(906480, 103154, 19322, '<td valign="top">Centered horizon spoils  shis for me</td>', 'Centered horizon spoils  shis for me', '2004-09-12 23:43:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(906484, 103160, 19322, '<td valign="top">Something not quite right about the "framing" by the two sets of legs.  It breaks up the scene, which is interesting.  Nice sharpness, though.</td>', 'Something not quite right about the "framing" by the two sets of legs.  It breaks up the scene, which is interesting.  Nice sharpness, though.', '2004-09-12 23:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(906485, 102416, 19322, '<td valign="top">Wish you could have avoided the centered horizon.</td>', 'Wish you could have avoided the centered horizon.', '2004-09-12 23:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(906486, 101772, 4226, '<td valign="top">I like the added noise in the photo</td>', 'I like the added noise in the photo', '2004-09-12 23:48:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(906490, 103224, 19322, '<td valign="top">A nice geometry lesson.</td>', 'A nice geometry lesson.', '2004-09-12 23:49:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(906494, 103240, 19322, '<td valign="top">I don''t think the vertical shot works well here.</td>', 'I don''t think the vertical shot works well here.', '2004-09-12 23:51:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(906495, 102642, 22734, '<td valign="top">Returning for comments.<br/>Lovely manor with their usual clean and crispy lawn and garden. Whenever we do architecture iy is highly important that the sensor is parallel with the building''s  vertical lines. Tiy check this by tilting the camera slightly until the lines rise true from bottom to top. A tripod with levels helps out. However, I am bumping up the image on the merit of its composition and color.</td>', 'Returning for comments.Lovely manor with their usual clean and crispy lawn and garden. Whenever we do architecture iy is highly important that the sensor is parallel with the building''s  vertical lines. Tiy check this by tilting the camera slightly until the lines rise true from bottom to top. A tripod with levels helps out. However, I am bumping up the image on the merit of its composition and color.', '2004-09-12 23:51:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(906497, 102654, 19322, '<td valign="top">Just a tad less river would be better</td>', 'Just a tad less river would be better', '2004-09-12 23:54:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(906500, 103232, 22734, '<td valign="top">Returning for comments.<br/> Wild looking little guy. Love the shallow dof to accentuate him. The backlight adds that extra touch. Bumping up.</td>', 'Returning for comments. Wild looking little guy. Love the shallow dof to accentuate him. The backlight adds that extra touch. Bumping up.', '2004-09-12 23:55:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(906502, 102508, 25468, '<td valign="top">Deleted<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-12-15 21:21:10.</i></td>', 'Deleted', '2004-09-12 23:55:53.000000', '2004-12-15 21:21:10.000000', 1),
(906510, 103156, 19322, '<td valign="top">Seems unsharp, and the direct frontal shot plus distortion detracts from this shot.</td>', 'Seems unsharp, and the direct frontal shot plus distortion detracts from this shot.', '2004-09-12 23:57:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(906514, 103165, 19322, '<td valign="top">For me, the slow shutter thing is overdone here, but many would disagree.</td>', 'For me, the slow shutter thing is overdone here, but many would disagree.', '2004-09-13 00:01:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(906520, 102530, 22046, '<td valign="top">Excellent photograph of this ship. You really get a sense of scale from this.</td>', 'Excellent photograph of this ship. You really get a sense of scale from this.', '2004-09-13 00:09:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(906526, 102295, 6804, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful work of art!   I like it a lot. The on-going debate over what makes a great photograph, The composition or the technical aspects of the photo? I know from experience you need to start out with a very well taken photograph.  I''m giving this a 8. Placement is excellent and the overall feel of the work tells a story. I think you may have taken the abstract effect just a little too far even for my taste. (Keeping in mind, this is a photography contest so the voters might not give this the credit I feel it deserves). This is an awesome and bold entry for DPC.</td>', 'This is a beautiful work of art!   I like it a lot. The on-going debate over what makes a great photograph, The composition or the technical aspects of the photo? I know from experience you need to start out with a very well taken photograph.  I''m giving this a 8. Placement is excellent and the overall feel of the work tells a story. I think you may have taken the abstract effect just a little too far even for my taste. (Keeping in mind, this is a photography contest so the voters might not give this the credit I feel it deserves). This is an awesome and bold entry for DPC.', '2004-09-13 00:10:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(906529, 102007, 22046, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and simple image. Very appealing.</td>', 'Beautiful and simple image. Very appealing.', '2004-09-13 00:10:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(906530, 102904, 14609, '<td valign="top">Love the detail and the perspective.  Great shot.</td>', 'Love the detail and the perspective.  Great shot.', '2004-09-13 00:10:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(906535, 101704, 19322, '<td valign="top">I like rodeos and I like this shot.  It looks like you used selective desaturation, but I''d like to know how you did it in this picture.</td>', 'I like rodeos and I like this shot.  It looks like you used selective desaturation, but I''d like to know how you did it in this picture.', '2004-09-13 00:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(906547, 101818, 25464, '<td valign="top">Interesting, different, could have been in a bet better focus.  A decent photo, but not the same quality as a lot of the more asthetically pleasing entries.</td>', 'Interesting, different, could have been in a bet better focus.  A decent photo, but not the same quality as a lot of the more asthetically pleasing entries.', '2004-09-13 00:14:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(906548, 102741, 22046, '<td valign="top">This certainly does say Holland to most of the rest of the world. Very nice.</td>', 'This certainly does say Holland to most of the rest of the world. Very nice.', '2004-09-13 00:14:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(906551, 103244, 19322, '<td valign="top">Be careful, Potter!</td>', 'Be careful, Potter!', '2004-09-13 00:15:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(906555, 103263, 19322, '<td valign="top">Croppin out some sky would help.</td>', 'Croppin out some sky would help.', '2004-09-13 00:16:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(906556, 103065, 22046, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of point of view and black and white. Very imposing structure.</td>', 'Excellent use of point of view and black and white. Very imposing structure.', '2004-09-13 00:16:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(906561, 102161, 25464, '<td valign="top">Not ordinarily a city scape fan, but this is nicely done.  Good job.</td>', 'Not ordinarily a city scape fan, but this is nicely done.  Good job.', '2004-09-13 00:18:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(906567, 103239, 19322, '<td valign="top">Focus needs improvement</td>', 'Focus needs improvement', '2004-09-13 00:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(906610, 102007, 19982, '<td valign="top">Absolutely stunning!  This one goes to the top of my list!<br/> <br/>P.S.  This one is my bet for the blue ribbon.</td>', 'Absolutely stunning!  This one goes to the top of my list! P.S.  This one is my bet for the blue ribbon.', '2004-09-13 00:33:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(906613, 102508, 7560, '<td valign="top">*sniffle* I''m getting all homesick. :)  I''ve shot from this location before, and like the angle. I personally prefer shooting from closer to Kissing Camels shooting south (East side) I like the fade away effect you get as the rocks fade into  the distance.  It''s nice to see the green. :)</td>', '*sniffle* I''m getting all homesick. :)  I''ve shot from this location before, and like the angle. I personally prefer shooting from closer to Kissing Camels shooting south (East side) I like the fade away effect you get as the rocks fade into  the distance.  It''s nice to see the green. :)', '2004-09-13 00:34:25.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(906614, 102123, 8891, '<td valign="top">Great tones, like the leading lines, the textures, and the shadows. This Tone is fabulous.!!!</td>', 'Great tones, like the leading lines, the textures, and the shadows. This Tone is fabulous.!!!', '2004-09-13 00:34:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(906616, 102007, 255, '<td valign="top">beautiful.</td>', 'beautiful.', '2004-09-13 00:34:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(906620, 102123, 255, '<td valign="top">very nice tones and leading line.  nice work.</td>', 'very nice tones and leading line.  nice work.', '2004-09-13 00:35:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(906621, 102973, 19982, '<td valign="top">I like the framing, done both the tree leaves at the top as well as the road and fence at the bottom.  I like the colors, the composition (windmill on the thirds line), the angles, the texture.  Great shot!  The only distracting thing is the shadows on the left side.  Since this is advanced editing, they could have been cloned out.  Good luck on the challenge!<br/> <br/>P.S.  I''m betting on a ribbon here ... or a least top 5.</td>', 'I like the framing, done both the tree leaves at the top as well as the road and fence at the bottom.  I like the colors, the composition (windmill on the thirds line), the angles, the texture.  Great shot!  The only distracting thing is the shadows on the left side.  Since this is advanced editing, they could have been cloned out.  Good luck on the challenge! P.S.  I''m betting on a ribbon here ... or a least top 5.', '2004-09-13 00:35:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(906622, 101801, 19982, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting and colors!  Good luck on the challenge!<br/> <br/>P.S.<br/>I''m betting on a top 5 finish here.  Good luck!</td>', 'Beautiful lighting and colors!  Good luck on the challenge! P.S.I''m betting on a top 5 finish here.  Good luck!', '2004-09-13 00:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(906623, 103254, 8891, '<td valign="top">This waterfront architecture is absolutely a knockout, but the picture is a bit on the dull side in brightness and saturation. Wow what great buildings. I do wish more emphasis had been place on them and less on the river and the boats.</td>', 'This waterfront architecture is absolutely a knockout, but the picture is a bit on the dull side in brightness and saturation. Wow what great buildings. I do wish more emphasis had been place on them and less on the river and the boats.', '2004-09-13 00:38:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(906630, 102676, 19982, '<td valign="top">Love the lighting and the colors!  Good luck on the challenge!<br/> <br/>P.S.  This has to be top 5.  Good luck!</td>', 'Love the lighting and the colors!  Good luck on the challenge! P.S.  This has to be top 5.  Good luck!', '2004-09-13 00:40:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(906631, 102332, 19982, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  I love the colors, the textures, the framing.  (though I bet you get negative comments on the border, the trees used to frame the photo are excellent)<br/>Good luck on the challenge!<br/> <br/>P.S. This has to be top 5.  Good luck!</td>', 'Beautiful!  I love the colors, the textures, the framing.  (though I bet you get negative comments on the border, the trees used to frame the photo are excellent)Good luck on the challenge! P.S. This has to be top 5.  Good luck!', '2004-09-13 00:41:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(906642, 102808, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic and engaging image! Since this is for a travel brochure, it may be interesting to try dodging in the structure at bottom so it''s not just a sillhouette. Nice work! 8</td>', 'Very dramatic and engaging image! Since this is for a travel brochure, it may be interesting to try dodging in the structure at bottom so it''s not just a sillhouette. Nice work! 8', '2004-09-13 00:48:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(906645, 103257, 6870, '<td valign="top">B/W was an intesting choice. I can see a photo like this going into a brochure for sure, but I think it would probably be in color. Regardless, this is an engaging photo!</td>', 'B/W was an intesting choice. I can see a photo like this going into a brochure for sure, but I think it would probably be in color. Regardless, this is an engaging photo!', '2004-09-13 00:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(906649, 102999, 6870, '<td valign="top">Wow, this makes we want to visit this place (a bit sarcastic, perhaps!). Thanks for braving the weather to bring us this photo! It surely captures the drama here!</td>', 'Wow, this makes we want to visit this place (a bit sarcastic, perhaps!). Thanks for braving the weather to bring us this photo! It surely captures the drama here!', '2004-09-13 00:51:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(906654, 103164, 8054, '<td valign="top">Nice candid people shot. A bit too red for my tastes, however, and the clouds are overexposed.</td>', 'Nice candid people shot. A bit too red for my tastes, however, and the clouds are overexposed.', '2004-09-13 00:53:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(906657, 102791, 8054, '<td valign="top">Contrast lacks depth and the clouds'' details are blown out. Seems like there is a bluish cast over the entire photo and is most apparent over the hills in the background.</td>', 'Contrast lacks depth and the clouds'' details are blown out. Seems like there is a bluish cast over the entire photo and is most apparent over the hills in the background.', '2004-09-13 00:55:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(906663, 102007, 10268, '<td valign="top">really beautiful, awesome colors.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-09-13 00:18:25.</i></td>', 'really beautiful, awesome colors.', '2004-09-13 00:58:11.000000', '2004-09-13 01:18:25.000000', 1),
(906665, 102285, 24911, '<td valign="top">A great photo. Loved the colors and the reality feelings. I only wish it was centered. 10.</td>', 'A great photo. Loved the colors and the reality feelings. I only wish it was centered. 10.', '2004-09-13 00:58:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(906668, 103223, 8054, '<td valign="top">Very nice vantage point. The people gice the photo a sense of scale. Just a bit hazy and levels and/or curves could take care of that.</td>', 'Very nice vantage point. The people gice the photo a sense of scale. Just a bit hazy and levels and/or curves could take care of that.', '2004-09-13 00:59:21.000000', NULL, 1),
