(906918, 102508, 5475, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by magicshutter:</b></div><hr/><i> try doing something original next time. check my portfolio for nearly the same shot, only yours is verticle. You even named it the same. Is this some sort of personal attack on my photo? I have requested you be disqualified. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Dude, you need to learn to play nice with the other kids...<br/>Thousands of people photograph this every year.  Due to the time of day and where the light was, I had to go to the NW side to get a shot.  I have no idea who you are, and I''ve never looked at you gallery.  And believe it or not, my title (and apparently yours, too) is not very creative or original.  Settle down and have fun.  You may not realize it, but there are lots of people besides yourself who have taken photos at Garden of the Gods!</td>', 'Originally posted by magicshutter: try doing something original next time. check my portfolio for nearly the same shot, only yours is verticle. You even named it the same. Is this some sort of personal attack on my photo? I have requested you be disqualified.   Dude, you need to learn to play nice with the other kids...Thousands of people photograph this every year.  Due to the time of day and where the light was, I had to go to the NW side to get a shot.  I have no idea who you are, and I''ve never looked at you gallery.  And believe it or not, my title (and apparently yours, too) is not very creative or original.  Settle down and have fun.  You may not realize it, but there are lots of people besides yourself who have taken photos at Garden of the Gods!', '2004-09-13 02:17:15.000000', NULL, 0),
