(907883, 102350, 12311, '<td valign="top">Stunning shot!!  Congratulations on the ribbon.  I MUST get to England!!!</td>', 'Stunning shot!!  Congratulations on the ribbon.  I MUST get to England!!!', '2004-09-13 15:46:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(907891, 102808, 13381, '<td valign="top">I think this photo is underrated.  Ideally, there would''ve been more light cast on the building itself, so it wouldn''t have been silhouetted against the sky, but I like the composition and perspective. No way this shot should''ve been left on the last page!</td>', 'I think this photo is underrated.  Ideally, there would''ve been more light cast on the building itself, so it wouldn''t have been silhouetted against the sky, but I like the composition and perspective. No way this shot should''ve been left on the last page!', '2004-09-13 15:58:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(907892, 101818, 5728, '<td valign="top">When I think of London this is one of th pictures that jumps to my mind :)</td>', 'When I think of London this is one of th pictures that jumps to my mind :)', '2004-09-13 16:01:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(907898, 102350, 23356, '<td valign="top">This is the most beautiful photograph. It makes you want to walk down the street and under the viaduct.  Congratulations.</td>', 'This is the most beautiful photograph. It makes you want to walk down the street and under the viaduct.  Congratulations.', '2004-09-13 16:06:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(907909, 103102, 4517, '<td valign="top">Deserved a top 10 place.</td>', 'Deserved a top 10 place.', '2004-09-13 16:14:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(907916, 102350, 3575, '<td valign="top">O..M..G.... I didn''t get a chance to vote so I didn''t see this until just now. There are so many elements in the photo that holds one''s interest for a long time and each time I look at it, I see something else, like the smoke coming from the chimney on the lower right. You couldn''t have chosen a better time of day and the way you composed the shot is alo perfect. I don''t understand any vote but 10''s on this one. WOW! If this photo of yours doesn''t make the viewer want to visit Yorkshire, nothing will. Congratulations!</td>', 'O..M..G.... I didn''t get a chance to vote so I didn''t see this until just now. There are so many elements in the photo that holds one''s interest for a long time and each time I look at it, I see something else, like the smoke coming from the chimney on the lower right. You couldn''t have chosen a better time of day and the way you composed the shot is alo perfect. I don''t understand any vote but 10''s on this one. WOW! If this photo of yours doesn''t make the viewer want to visit Yorkshire, nothing will. Congratulations!', '2004-09-13 16:19:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(907985, 102007, 8860, '<td valign="top">Hey Jon - well done on the placing and yes, I suppose I''ve become too retouch conscious! And thanks for pointing it out in the thread. ; )</td>', 'Hey Jon - well done on the placing and yes, I suppose I''ve become too retouch conscious! And thanks for pointing it out in the thread. ; )', '2004-09-13 16:48:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(907993, 101801, 24764, '<td valign="top">Jon, there is definitely strong sense of drama in this shot. The area where the shadow is dim is very powerful, it dares you to walk up to it to discover. Great shot congratulations.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-09-13 17:56:51.</i></td>', 'Jon, there is definitely strong sense of drama in this shot. The area where the shadow is dim is very powerful, it dares you to walk up to it to discover. Great shot congratulations.', '2004-09-13 16:59:43.000000', '2004-09-13 18:56:51.000000', 0),
(908017, 102350, 24454, '<td valign="top">Hope we like it ??????????   Are you kidding?????   This shot is almost to beautiful to be real!   I voted on this challenge, but wasn''t able to vote every single picture, so I missed this one.   I agree with the comment below.  I don''t see how this picture could have gotten any vote but 10!!!  I can''t help but think this print will sell so well because I can envision it so well matted and framed on a wall!   Congratulations on your well-deserved 1st place!</td>', 'Hope we like it ??????????   Are you kidding?????   This shot is almost to beautiful to be real!   I voted on this challenge, but wasn''t able to vote every single picture, so I missed this one.   I agree with the comment below.  I don''t see how this picture could have gotten any vote but 10!!!  I can''t help but think this print will sell so well because I can envision it so well matted and framed on a wall!   Congratulations on your well-deserved 1st place!', '2004-09-13 17:31:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(908043, 102350, 714, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, clear print!  Congrats on the 1st place ribbon!</td>', 'Beautiful, clear print!  Congrats on the 1st place ribbon!', '2004-09-13 17:39:17.000000', NULL, 0),
