(909215, 103223, 12311, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by MrAkamai:</b></div><hr/><i> Now that I see you took the photo with a 10D, you should consider investing in a polarizer. It would have helped considerably with the haze in the sky. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Thanks for taking the time to vote, and for the advice.  I have a polarizer, but, alas, didn''t have it with me on this day :-(</td>', 'Originally posted by MrAkamai: Now that I see you took the photo with a 10D, you should consider investing in a polarizer. It would have helped considerably with the haze in the sky.  Thanks for taking the time to vote, and for the advice.  I have a polarizer, but, alas, didn''t have it with me on this day :-(', '2004-09-14 11:57:55.000000', NULL, 0),
