(909851, 102350, 4871, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by theSaj:</b></div><hr/><i> Great shot...although I think the sky is the one aspect I don''t really care for. Maybe it''s the two-tone look of bluish cyan and white.<br/> <br/>*shrug*<br/> <br/>Great bridge.... </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Agreed! I didn''t have a graduated nd filter to use and I couldn''t use my two exposures as its using two images. If I''m wrong please someone tell me! It would make a lot of my exposures winners!! Check the difference between this image and the image available for print.</td>', 'Originally posted by theSaj: Great shot...although I think the sky is the one aspect I don''t really care for. Maybe it''s the two-tone look of bluish cyan and white. *shrug* Great bridge....   Agreed! I didn''t have a graduated nd filter to use and I couldn''t use my two exposures as its using two images. If I''m wrong please someone tell me! It would make a lot of my exposures winners!! Check the difference between this image and the image available for print.', '2004-09-14 19:16:45.000000', NULL, 0),
