(2917317, 102350, 66926, '<td valign="top">That is a truly beautiful photograph. <br/> <br/>I live in Knaresborough, and cross the viaduct in the picture twice each day on the train. I never tire of the view.  This composition has been used many times in both photograph and painting, yet this is absolutely the best I''ve seen this view look.<br/> <br/>Well done, and well deserved - and thanks for adding to the publication of Knaresborough as the most beautiful town in England.  :)</td>', 'That is a truly beautiful photograph.  I live in Knaresborough, and cross the viaduct in the picture twice each day on the train. I never tire of the view.  This composition has been used many times in both photograph and painting, yet this is absolutely the best I''ve seen this view look. Well done, and well deserved - and thanks for adding to the publication of Knaresborough as the most beautiful town in England.  :)', '2006-10-11 09:24:57.000000', NULL, 0),
